prisma/schema.prisma uses the postgresql provider and defines the singleton SchoolSettings model with the fields listed in the PRD.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 Database, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-8\",  \"description\": \"src/server/db.ts exports a single globalThis-cached Prisma client instance that survives hot reload in development.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 Database, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"prisma/seed.ts is idempotent (re-running never creates duplicates) and creates the SchoolSettings row.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 Database, item 3 + Seed Data\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"src/server/http.ts exports ok(data, init?) returning NextResponse.json({ data }).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 API helpers, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"src/server/http.ts exports paginated(data, { page, pageSize, total }) returning the list response shape.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 API helpers, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"src/server/http.ts exports apiError(code, message, details?) returning the error shape with the HTTP status mapped from the code table.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 API helpers, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"src/server/http.ts exports withHandler(fn) that maps ZodError to VALIDATION_ERROR, AppError to its mapped status, Prisma P2002 to CONFLICT, P2025 to NOT_FOUND, and anything else to INTERNAL (stack logged, never returned to client).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 API helpers, item 4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"src/server/http.ts exports parsePagination(searchParams) returning { page, pageSize, skip, take }, clamping pageSize to max 100 and page to min 1.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 API helpers, item 5\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"