ver/auth/config.ts): single Credentials provider calling authorize(), JWT session strategy (8h lifetime), jwt/session callbacks stamping id/role/firstName/lastName/email and applying the passwordChangedAt invalidation check throttled to once per 5 minutes; plus the App Router catch-all route re-exporting GET/POST handlers (serves /api/auth/callback/credentials, /session, /signout, /csrf).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/config.ts\", \"src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"middleware.ts perimeter: redirects unauthenticated (app) requests to /login?callbackUrl=<path>; returns 401 JSON for /api/* except /api/health, /api/auth/* and paths listed in the new src/config/public-routes.ts allowlist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"middleware.ts\", \"src/config/public-routes.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Permission helpers (src/server/auth/permissions.ts): getCurrentUser(), requireUser() (throws UNAUTHENTICATED / redirects to /login), requireRole(...roles) (throws FORBIDDEN / redirects to /forbidden) — no generic can() helper by design.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/permissions.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"/login page: MUI Card/TextField/Button/InputAdornment+IconButton show-password toggle, Alert for form errors, submits via signIn('credentials'), honors the callbackUrl guard, aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" errors with focus-to-first-invalid-field.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(public)/login/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\", \"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Accept-invitation: POST /api/auth/invite/accept route (through http.ts's ok/apiError/withHandler/parseBody, 410 INVALID_TOKEN on bad/expired/used token) plus /invite/[token] page showing the invited user's name/email read-only with new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/invite/accept/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/invite/[token]/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-7\", \"TASK-8\", \"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n      \"description\": \"Forgot-password: POST /api/auth/forgot-password route (always-200 generic message, rate-limited 3/email/hr + 10/IP/hr) plus /forgot-password page with the email field and the same generic confirmation.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/forgot-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/forgot-password/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-8\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-18\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-17\",\n      \"description\": \"Reset-password: POST /api/auth/reset-password route (410 INVALID_TOKEN on bad/expired/used token, clears lockout fields, audits auth.password.reset) plus /reset-password/[token] page with new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/reset-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/reset-password/[token]/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-7\", \"TASK-8\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-19\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-18\",\n      \"description\": \"Change-password: POST /api/auth/change-password route (requireUser() backstop, wrong-current-password as field-level VALIDATION_ERROR, bumps passwordChangedAt, re-issues current session token) plus /account/security page with current/new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/change-password/route.ts\", \"src/app/(app)/account/security/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-8\", \"TASK-11\", \"TASK-13\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-19\",\n      \"description\": \"App shell integration: replace shell.tsx's PLACEHOLDER_USER with the real session (name/role badge/avatar initials, sign-out via signOut()), add the 'Account security' menu entry, have layout.tsx pass the real session down, and switch navigation.ts's filter call from the placeholder role to the session's real role (verify the existing filter signature rather than rewriting it, per FR-26's MEDIUM-confidence note).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/layout.tsx\", \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\", \"src/config/navigation.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\", \"TASK-13\", \"TASK-18\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-21\", \"FR-25\", \"FR-26\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-20\",\n      \"description\": \"Seed six ACTIVE users (admin, two teachers, two students, one parent; password SchoolHub123!) and one INVITED user via the service layer's createUser/createInviteToken, logging the invited user's invite link through sendAuthEmail.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-21\",\n      \"description\": \"Vitest unit tests: password-policy rule coverage, token hash/expiry/revoke behaviour, rate-limiter sliding-window boundaries, callbackUrl same-origin guard.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/unit/auth-validators.test.ts\", \"tests/unit/tokens.test.ts\", \"tests/unit/rate-limit.test.ts\", \"tests/unit/callback-url.test.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-7\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-22\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend tests/unit/http.test.ts with branch coverage for the three new error codes (RATE_LIMITED/UNAUTHENTICATED/INVALID_TOKEN) added in TASK-2, keeping the existing cases green.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/unit/http.test.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-23\",\n      \"description\": \"Vitest integration tests against the existing Docker Compose test database: authorize() branches (unknown user, wrong password, locked, disabled, success), accept-invite's atomic step, reset-password, change-password. Add tests/integration/**/*.test.ts to vitest.config.ts's include globs.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/integration/authorize.test.ts\", \"tests/integration/invite-accept.test.ts\", \"tests/integration/reset-password.test.ts\", \"tests/integration/change-password.test.ts\", \"vitest.config.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-9\", \"TASK-15\", \"TASK-17\", \"TASK-18\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-24\",\n      \"description\": \"Playwright e2e: sign-in/out plus failed-login messaging (unknown user, wrong password, locked, disabled) in one spec; the forgot-password-to-reset-password round trip in another.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/e2e/sign-in.spec.ts\", \"tests/e2e/forgot-reset.spec.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\", \"TASK-16\", \"TASK-17\", \"TASK-19\"],\n   