{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UMuzxJTsEWPoYM3j4KSGjQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-02\",\n3\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T13:07:00Z\",\n4\t  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n5\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"functionalRequirements\": [\n8\t    { \"id\": \"FR-1\",  \"description\": \"Add Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject and Room exactly as specified (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1 Data model\" },\n9\t    { \"id\": \"FR-2\",  \"description\": \"School settings screen (/admin/settings/school): form over every editable SchoolSettings field, with timezone as a searchable select of IANA zone names via Intl.supportedValuesOf('timeZone').\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 School settings, item 1\" },\n10\t    { \"id\": \"FR-3\",  \"description\": \"Logo is a plain URL field in this PRD; PRD-08 will later replace it with an upload control.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 School settings, item 2\" },\n11\t    { \"id\": \"FR-4\",  \"description\": \"Saving school settings writes an audit entry settings.school.update with changed field names in metadata.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 School settings, item 3\" },\n12\t    { \"id\": \"FR-5\",  \"description\": \"getSchoolSettings() in src/server/services/settings.ts is cached per request via React cache(); the top bar and public footer consume it.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 School settings, item 4\" },\n13\t    { \"id\": \"FR-6\",  \"description\": \"Academic years screen (/admin/academic-years): table with name, start date, end date, term count, current badge, actions.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 1\" },\n14\t    { \"id\": \"FR-7\",  \"description\": \"Create/edit academic-year dialog validates end date after start date and that the date range does not overlap any other academic year, surfacing 'Dates overlap with <year>.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 2\" },\n15\t    { \"id\": \"FR-8\",  \"description\": \"'Set as current' action (behind a confirm dialog) sets isCurrent = true on the chosen year and false on all others inside one transaction.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 3\" },\n16\t    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"Deleting an academic year is blocked (action disabled, tooltip 'In use — cannot delete') unless it has zero terms and is referenced by no other record.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 4\" },\n17\t    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"getCurrentAcademicYear() returns the current year with terms ordered by order (or null); getCurrentTerm(date = today) returns the term containing the date in the school timezone (or null).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 5\" },\n18\t    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"When no academic year is marked current, every admin page shows a dismissible banner: 'No current academic year is set. Set one in Academic Years.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Academic years, item 6\" },\n19\t    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Academic year detail page (/admin/academic-years/[id]) lists the year's terms in order with inline create, edit and delete.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Terms, item 1\" },\n20\t    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Term validation: dates must fall inside the academic year's range and must not overlap sibling terms; order auto-assigns as max+1 and is editable via drag handle or up/down buttons.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Terms, item 2\" },\n21\t    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"Term dialogs use MUI X DatePicker; a 'Generate terms' shortcut (2 semesters / 3 trimesters / 4 quarters) splits the year range into equal consecutive, named, contiguous terms, and is available only when the year has zero terms.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 Terms, item 3\" },\n22\t    { \"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Grade levels screen (/admin/grade-levels): table with name, short name, order, active-student-count column (shows '—' until PRD-03 exists), status; create/edit dialog; reorder via up/down buttons; archive/unarchive instead of delete when referenced.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Grade levels\" },\n23\t    { \"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"Subjects screen (/admin/subjects): table with colour swatch, name, code, description, status, searchable by name/code; create/edit dialog with a 12-swatch MUI ToggleButtonGroup colour picker (each swatch >=4.5:1 contrast, each with an aria-label naming the colour); code is stored upper-case and a duplicate code surfaces a field error 'Code already used by <subject>.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Subjects\" },\n24\t    { \"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"Rooms screen (/admin/rooms): table with name, building, capacity, status; create/edit/archive.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 Rooms\" },\n25\t    { \"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"Add an 'Administration' sidebar group (ADMIN role only) in src/config/navigation.ts linking to School settings, Academic years, Grade levels, Subjects and Rooms.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Navigation\" },\n26\t    { \"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"REST surface: GET/PATCH /api/settings/school; GET/POST /api/academic-years, PATCH/DELETE /api/academic-years/:id, POST .../set-current, POST .../terms, POST .../terms/generate; PATCH/DELETE /api/terms/:id, POST /api/terms/reorder; GET/POST + PATCH for /api/grade-levels, /api/subjects, /api/rooms — per the role/body table, with archive/unarchive as PATCH { archived } and an audit row per write.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table\" },\n27\t    { \"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"Seed data: academic year 2026–2027 (current) with Semester 1 and Semester 2; grade levels G6/G7/G8; six named subjects with codes; five named rooms with capacities.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Seed Data\" }\n28\t  ],\n29\t\n30\t  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n31\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-1\", \"description\": \"Overlap/range checks for academic years and terms run in the service layer inside a database transaction so two simultaneous requests cannot both succeed.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 1 (Integrity)\" },\n32\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-2\", \"description\": \"Each admin list page (academic years, grade levels, subjects, rooms) renders in under 500ms with 50 records.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 2 (Performance)\" },\n33\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"Every table has an empty state with a 'Create …' call to action.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 3 (Usability)\" },\n34\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-4\", \"description\": \"Every visible element in this PRD is built from Material UI (@mui/material, @mui/icons-material, MUI X packages) only, looked up through the MUI MCP server before use; the platform's banned UI/styling library list is enforced by ESLint no-restricted-imports.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"UI component rule (mandatory), items 1-6\" },\n35\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-5\", \"description\": \"All timestamps stored in UTC, displayed in the school timezone from SchoolSettings.timezone; date-only fields use @db.Date; DateDisplay re-renders correctly when the timezone changes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Code layout and conventions / Acceptance Criteria 6\" },\n36\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Every write handler enforces role server-side via requireRole('ADMIN') — a GET is open to any signed-in user, writes are ADMIN-only, and a non-admin write attempt returns 403.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"API table + Acceptance Criteria 5\" },\n37\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"Mutations write an AuditLog row via the existing audit() helper with action <entity>.create|update|archive|delete, and response envelopes follow the shared { data } / { data, page, pageSize, total } / { error: { code, message, details } } shape with the documented error codes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Code layout and conventions\" },\n38\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"Test coverage: Vitest unit tests for overlap detection, term-generation day-splitting (including odd day counts) and subject-code normalisation; Vitest integration tests for the set-current transaction and delete-in-use conflict; Playwright e2e for creating a year, generating terms, setting current, and creating a subject and a room.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements\" },\n39\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-9\", \"description\": \"Brownfield discipline: reuse existing PRD-00/PRD-01 models, services, components and helpers (SchoolSettings, audit(), requireRole(), DataTable, useToast()); never re-scaffold the project, duplicate an existing helper, or rename an existing route or model.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Platform Context, paragraph 1\" },\n40\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-10\", \"description\": \"Delivery discipline: keep npm run lint/typecheck/test passing, add only the tests listed in this PRD, and do not expand scope into sections/courses (PRD-05), bell-schedule periods (PRD-06), grading scales (PRD-11) or holidays (PRD-14).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Out of Scope + Assumptions and constraints, Constraints\" }\n41\t  ],\n42\t\n43\t  \"overallConfidencePct\": 100,\n44\t  \"clarificationLog\": [],\n45\t  \"status\": \"complete\"\n46\t}\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd056bf4-3785-420e-8a1f-0c3d146fa266","uuid"