raints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields) and generate the migration.\",","       \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","       \"estimateHours\": 2,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-2\",","-      \"description\": \"Extend src/server/http.ts's ApiErrorCode union and ERROR_STATUS map with RATE_LIMITED (429), UNAUTHENTICATED (401), INVALID_TOKEN (410) — extend the one existing map, do not fork a second error-mapping file.\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/server/http.ts\"],","+      \"description\": \"Create the shared requireRole() server-side role-check chokepoint and audit() AuditLog-insert helper that every write endpoint in this ticket calls.\",","+      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/requireRole.ts\", \"src/server/audit.ts\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","-      \"estimateHours\": 1,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-7\", \"NFR-8\"]","+      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-3\",","-      \"description\": \"Password policy Zod schema (10-128 chars, letter+digit, not-email, not-common-password) in src/lib/validators/auth.ts, backed by a bundled 1,000-entry common-passwords list, exported for reuse by both server validation and the client-side live strength checklist.\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/auth.ts\", \"src/lib/validators/common-passwords.json\"],","+      \"description\": \"Create a shared date-range overlap/containment validation utility reused by both the academic-years and terms services inside DB transactions.\",","+      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/dateRange.ts\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","-      \"estimateHours\": 2,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]","+      \"estimateHours\": 1,","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\"]","     },","     {","       \"