"status\": \"complete\""," }"]}],"originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-2\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-16T22:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/schema.prisma with User, AuthToken, AuditLog models and the Role/UserStatus/AuthTokenType enums (brownfield addition alongside the existing SchoolSettings model, same DB/ORM, no new migration tooling).\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend src/server/http.ts's ApiErrorCode union and ERROR_STATUS map with RATE_LIMITED (429), UNAUTHENTICATED (401), INVALID_TOKEN (410) — extend the one existing map, do not fork a second error-mapping file.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/http.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-7\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Password policy Zod schema (10-128 chars, letter+digit, not-email, not-common-password) in src/lib/validators/auth.ts, backed by a bundled 1,000-entry common-passwords list, exported for reuse by both server validation and the client-side live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/auth.ts\", \"src/lib/validators/common-passwords.json\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"audit() insert-only helper in src/server/audit.ts: writes an AuditLog row, captures IP from x-forwarded-for when a request is passed, never throws (logs on failure instead), never writes password hashes/raw tokens/full passwords into metadata.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/audit.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-8\", \"FR-24\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"In-memory sliding-window rate limiter (src/server/rate-limit.ts) with a configurable key, covering both the sign-in limit (10/IP/5min) and the forgot-password limits (3/email/hr, 10/IP/hr) from one exported implementation.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/rate-limit.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-17\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"sendAuthEmail() stub in src/server/email/send-auth-email.ts logging recipient/subject/link via logger.info, with a stable signature so PRD-04 can swap the implementation later without touching call sites.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/email/send-auth-email.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared token helper (src/server/auth/tokens.ts): crypto.randomBytes(32) base64url generation, crypto.createHash('sha256') hashing, crypto.timingSafeEqual lookup comparison, and revokeUnusedTokens(userId, type) — the one producer both the invite and reset flows call, so the reset-specific invalidate-on-reissue rule doesn't leak into the invite path.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/tokens.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-18\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Service layer src/server/services/users.ts: createUser (CONFLICT on duplicate email), createInviteToken, sendInvite, setUserStatus, unlockUser, plus the accept-invite atomic step (validate->hash->activate->mark-used->audit) and the reset-issuance/reset-password steps, all built on the existing Prisma singleton. Add bcrypt as a new dependency in package.json (cost-12 hashing).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\", \"package.json\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-3\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-7\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"authorize() chokepoint (src/server/auth/authorize.ts): rate-limit check before DB work, email normalize, status/lockout branch, dummy bcrypt-compare for a non-existent user (timing safety), real bcrypt compare (cost 12), failedLoginCount/lockedUntil mutation, audit() calls for login.success/login.failure/lockout.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/authorize.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-3\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-5\", \"FR-8\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Same-origin callbackUrl guard (src/lib/callback-url.ts): returns the relative path when it's same-origin, else a /dashboard fallback.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/lib/callback-url.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Auth.js (NextAuth v5) config (src/server/auth/config.ts): single Credentials provider calling authorize(), JWT session strategy (8h lifetime), jwt/session callbacks stamping id/role/firstName/lastName/email and applying the passwordChangedAt invalidation check throttled to once per 5 minutes; plus the App Router catch-all route re-exporting GET/POST handlers (serves /api/auth/callback/credentials, /session, /signout, /csrf).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/config.ts\", \"src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"middleware.ts perimeter: redirects unauthenticated (app) requests to /login?callbackUrl=<path>; returns 401 JSON for /api/* except /api/health, /api/auth/* and paths listed in the new src/config/public-routes.ts allowlist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"middleware.ts\", \"src/config/public-routes.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Permission helpers (src/server/auth/permissions.ts): getCurrentUser(), requireUser() (throws UNAUTHENTICATED / redirects to /login), requireRole(...roles) (throws FORBIDDEN / redirects to /forbidden) — no generic can() helper by design.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/permissions.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"/login page: MUI Card/TextField/Button/InputAdornment+IconButton show-password toggle, Alert for form errors, submits via signIn('credentials'), honors the callbackUrl guard, aria-live=\\\"polite\\\" errors with focus-to-first-invalid-field.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(public)/login/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\", \"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-7\", \"NFR-4\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Accept-invitation: POST /api/auth/invite/accept route (through http.ts's ok/apiError/withHandler/parseBody, 410 INVALID_TOKEN on bad/expired/used token) plus /invite/[token] page showing the invited user's name/email read-only with new/confirm-password fields and the live strength checklist.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/auth/invite/accept/route.ts\", \"src/app/(public)/invite/[token]/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dep