    (CREATE)\n      students/\n        [studentId]/page.tsx            (CREATE)\n      my-children/\n        page.tsx                        (CREATE)\n      account/\n        profile/page.tsx                (CREATE)\n\ntests/\n  unit/\n    userValidators.test.ts              (CREATE)\n    userNumberGenerators.test.ts        (CREATE)\n    csv.test.ts                         (CREATE)\n    studentAccess.test.ts               (CREATE)\n    userImport.integration.test.ts      (CREATE)\n    users.integration.test.ts           (CREATE)\n    userLinks.integration.test.ts       (CREATE)\n  e2e/\n    user-management.spec.ts             (CREATE)\n```\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":97,"newStart":1,"newLines":101,"lines":["-# File structure — PRD-02 School Settings & Academic Structure (abcd-02)","+# File Structure — ticket abcd-03 (PRD-03 User Management)"," ","-> Brownfield ticket. Only new/changed files are marked; everything else","-> under `src/` (DataTable, EmptyState, ConfirmDialog, FormField, PageHeader,","-> DateDisplay, useToast, theme, db, http, logger) is reused as-is per NFR-9.","->","-> **Gap note:** `requireRole()` and `audit()` are assumed \"existing\" by the","-> PRD, but PRD-01 (ticket abcd-2)'s dev phase never landed them in `src/`","-> (confirmed: no `src/server/auth*`, no `auth.ts`, `AppShell` still uses a","-> `PLACEHOLDER_USER`). TASK-2 adds minimal, single-chokepoint stand-ins","-> consistent with that existing placeholder pattern so every write endpoint","-> has one real place to swap in PRD-01's real session once it lands —","-> not a parallel auth system.","+Brownfield additions only. Everything under `(existing)` already exists in","+`src/` from PRD-00/01/02 and is reused as-is (no new file) — listed here","+only for orientation, not as a task output."," "," ```"," prisma/","-  schema.prisma                                  (MODIFY — add AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject, Room)","-  seed.ts                                        