bcd-02\",","+  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",","   \"version\": \"1.0\",","-  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T13:50:00Z\",","+  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",","   \"phase\": \"dev-planning\","," ","   \"notes\": [","-    \"No system-design.md exists for abcd-02 (arch-design-system left a stale abcd-2 copy; see artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json blockers). This plan is derived directly from artifacts/intake/requirements.json (ticketId abcd-02, read from the canonical /Users/ikramaansari/artifacts/intake/ location since this project's artifacts/intake/ also holds stale abcd-2 data) and artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json, cross-checked against the live prisma/schema.prisma and src/ tree.\",","-    \"requireRole() and audit() are assumed 'existing' by the PRD (NFR-9) but were never created: PRD-01/ticket abcd-2's dev phase did not land (artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows firstPassAccepted: false, 3 reruns), so src/ has no auth wiring at all — AppShell still runs on a hardcoded PLACEHOLDER_USER. TASK-2 adds minimal, single-chokepoint stand-ins (consistent with that existing placeholder pattern) so every write endpoint has exactly one place to swap in real session logic once PRD-01 lands, instead of 6 services duplicating ad hoc role checks.\"","+    \"Sequencing dependency carried from architect (system-design.md Status / handoff-to-dev-planning.json blocker, advisory): PRD-01 (real auth/session) has not landed in src/ — only requireRole.ts's ADMIN placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns (User.lockedUntil/failedLoginCount/passwordChangedAt, AuthToken) exist. TASK-6 (src/server/services/users.ts) implements sendInvite(userId) as a stub behind the same placeholder convention requireRole.ts already establishes (log + no-op), so TASK-9's /invite route and TASK-23's 'send invitation now' checkbox call the real interface name now and need zero call-site changes when PRD-01 lands. Likewise TASK-9's /status route only guarantees status=DISABLED is correct the instant it commits; the 'sessions stop within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session-refresh check re-reading status, not rebuilt here (NFR-7).\",","+    \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence per intake/architect: TASK-6/TASK-9 clear exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, the two fields already in prisma/schema.prisma. No other lockout field exists in the current schema (verified in TASK-1's read of prisma/schema.prisma), so this is implemented as specified.\",","+    \"navigation.ts currently has no 'Administration' group concept (PRD-02's grouped-sidebar work did not land — artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows its dev phase never passed). TASK-25 adds flat NavItem entries (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children) matching the existing flat-array pattern rather than inventing new grouping UI, per NFR-8 (no scope beyond this PRD's sections). shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' MenuItem is a dead button today (no href) — TASK-25 wires it to /account/profile.\"","   ],"," ","   \"tasks\": [","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-1\",","-      \"description\": \"Add Prisma models AcademicYear, Term, GradeLevel, Subject, Room to schema.prisma (unique constraints, onDelete: Restrict on Term.academicYear, archivedAt soft-delete fields) and generate the migration.\",","+      \"description\": \"Add StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile, ParentStudentLink models and Gender/GuardianRelationship enums to schema.prisma, with relations from User, and the (lastName, firstName, email) composite index on User; generate the migration.\",","       \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","       \"estimateHours\": 2,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\"]","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-2\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-2\",","-      \"description\": \"Create the shared requireRole() server-side role-check chokepoint and audit() AuditLog-insert helper that every write endpoint in this ticket calls.\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/requireRole.ts\", \"src/server/audit.ts\"],","+      \"description\": \"Shared CSV util: escapeCsvCell() (leading =,+,-,@ -> apostrophe-prefixed) and toCsv(), the single choke point used by every CSV-generation path (export, import error report).\",","+      \"files\": [\"src/server/csv.ts\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","       \"estimateHours\": 1.5,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-7\"]","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-3\",","-      \"description\": \"Create a shared date-range overlap/containment validation utility reused by both the academic-years and terms services inside DB transactions.\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/dateRange.ts\"],","+      \"description\": \"Read-only GET /api/audit-logs over the existing AuditLog table with actorId/actionPrefix/dateFrom/dateTo filters and pagination; no new write path.\",","+      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts\"],","       \"dependencies\": [],","-      \"estimateHours\": 1,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\"]","+      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-4\",","-      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/seed.ts: academic year 2026-2027 (current) with Semester 1/2, grade levels G6/G7/G8, six named subjects with codes, five named rooms with capacities.\",","-      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],","+      \"description\": \"Shared Zod schemas (one per entity: student/teacher/parent row) for DOB 3-21yo and phone ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$ validation, used as both the RHF resolver and the CSV row validator — single source of truth.\",","+      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/users.ts\"],","       \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],","-      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\"]","+      \"estimateHours\": 2,","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-19\", \