w files)' and 'all components,' not a dedicated component. No task cites them as a primary requirementId for that reason; they are enforced by how each task above is written (reuse DataTable/ConfirmDialog/UserAvatar/EmptyState/FormField/PageHeader/Toast, reuse requireRole()/audit()/http.ts helpers, additive-only schema and routes) rather than by a TASK-N that builds them.\"\n  ],","originalFile":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T15:10:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Sequencing dependency carried from architect (system-design.md Status / handoff-to-dev-planning.json blocker, advisory): PRD-01 (real auth/session) has not landed in src/ — only requireRole.ts's ADMIN placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns (User.lockedUntil/failedLoginCount/passwordChangedAt, AuthToken) exist. TASK-6 (src/server/services/users.ts) implements sendInvite(userId) as a stub behind the same placeholder convention requireRole.ts already establishes (log + no-op), so TASK-9's /invite route and TASK-23's 'send invitation now' checkbox call the real interface name now and need zero call-site changes when PRD-01 lands. Likewise TASK-9's /status route only guarantees status=DISABLED is correct the instant it commits; the 'sessions stop within 5 minutes' effect (FR-12) is PRD-01's session-refresh check re-reading status, not rebuilt here (NFR-7).\",\n    \"FR-31 (POST /api/users/:id/unlock) is MEDIUM confidence per intake/architect: TASK-6/TASK-9 clear exactly lockedUntil and failedLoginCount, the two fields already in prisma/schema.prisma. No other lockout field exists in the current schema (verified in TASK-1's read of prisma/schema.prisma), so this is implemented as specified.\",\n    \"navigation.ts currently has no 'Administration' group concept (PRD-02's grouped-sidebar work did not land — artifacts/dev/dev-rerun-count.json shows its dev phase never passed). TASK-25 adds flat NavItem entries (Users, Import users, Audit log, My children) matching the existing flat-array pattern rather than inventing new grouping UI, per NFR-8 (no scope beyond this PRD's sections). shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' MenuItem is a dead button today (no href) — TASK-25 wires it to /account/profile.\"\n  ],\n\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile, ParentStudentLink models and Gender/GuardianRelationship enums to schema.prisma, with relations from User, and the (lastName, firstName, email) composite index on User; generate the migration.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared CSV util: escapeCsvCell() (leading =,+,-,@ -> apostrophe-prefixed) and toCsv(), the single choke point used by every CSV-generation path (export, import error report).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/csv.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Read-only GET /api/audit-logs over the existing AuditLog table with actorId/actionPrefix/dateFrom/dateTo filters and pagination; no new write path.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Shared Zod schemas (one per entity: student/teacher/parent row) for DOB 3-21yo and phone ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$ validation, used as both the RHF resolver and the CSV row validator — single source of truth.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/lib/validators/users.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-20\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"linkParentToStudent/unlinkParentFromStudent: inside one transaction, reject a 5th link for a student and clear isPrimary on every other link when the new link sets isPrimary=true.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/userLinks.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Core user service: createUser/updateUser (role immutable, email-change invalidates pending INVITE AuthTokens)/listUsers (filtered, paginated, uses the new index)/getUserDetail (profile+links+20 recent audit rows)/setUserStatus/archiveUser/restoreUser/unlockUser (clears lockedUntil+failedLoginCount), admissionNumber (S<year>-####)/employeeNumber (T-####) generators, self-disable and last-active-admin guards, and sendInvite(userId) as a stubbed PRD-01 interface (see notes).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-31\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"getAccessibleStudentIds(user) (ADMIN->'ALL', STUDENT->[self], PARENT->linked ids via userLinks, TEACHER->[] until PRD-05) and assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId) (FORBIDDEN/NOT_FOUND, never revealing existence to STUDENT/PARENT).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"GET/POST /api/users (list with role/status/gradeLevelId/q/includeArchived filters + pagination; create) and GET/PATCH /api/users/:id (detail; update with server-side role-immutability rejection).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/users/[id]/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"NFR-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"POST /api/users/:id/{invite,unlock,status,archive,restore}: resend invite, clear lockout fields, set ACTIVE/DISABLED with self/last-admin guard, archive (archivedAt+DISABLED), restore (clear archivedAt). All audit() on write.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/invite/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/unlock/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/status/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/archive/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/users/[id]/restore/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\", \"FR-12\", \"FR-13\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-31\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n      \"description\": \"GET /api/users/export (same filters as list, text/csv, medicalNotes omitted, every cell through escapeCsvCell) and GET /api/users/search (ADMIN/TEACHER, <=20 rows, {id,name,email,role}, archived excluded).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/export/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/users/search/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-2\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-5\", \"FR-28\", \"NFR-1\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Server-side import batch transaction: re-validates every row against TASK-4's schemas (never trusts the client), one prisma.$transaction per 200-row batch (all-or-rollback), case-insensitive grade-level match by name/shortName, strict YYYY-MM-DD dates, existing-email rows skipped not errored; plus the two static downloadable CSV templates.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/services/userImport.ts\",\n        \"public/templates/students-template.csv\",\n        \"public/templates/teachers-template.csv\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-4\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"POST /api/students/:id/parents (link, 5th-link/single-primary invariants via TASK-5) and DELETE /api/students/:id/parents/:parentId (unlink).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/[parentId]/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"GET /api/students/:id gated by assertCanViewStudent, medicalNotes stripped server-side for STUDENT/PARENT before the response is built.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/students/[id]/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-7\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\", \"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"GET /api/me/children (PARENT, linked children for My Children) and PATCH /api/me/profile (self only; phone + occupation/address for PARENT; name/email/role read-only here).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/me/children/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/me/profile/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\", \"FR-27\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"POST /api/users/import: accepts type+rows+sendInvites, calls TASK-11's batch transaction, returns summary + per-row results + error-report CSV URL via TASK-2's csv util.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/import/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\", \"TASK-2\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n      \"description\": \"Reusable UserPicker on MUI Autocomplete (async, multiple, avatar+name+role renderOption) consuming GET /api/users/search.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/components/UserPicker/UserPicker.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-28\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-17\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/users list page: DataTable (avatar+name, email, role chip, status chip, grade level, last sign-in, actions), role/status/gradeLevel/search/show-archived filters, row actions (View/Edit/Resend/Unlock/Disable-Enable/Archive-Restore) and bulk actions (Resend/Disable/Export CSV) via ConfirmDialog for destructive ones.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\", \"TASK-9\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\", \"FR-4\", \"FR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-18\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/users/[id] detail page: profile data, status, last sign-in, linked family members, 20 most recent audit entries.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/[id]/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-11\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-19\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/users/import page: template download links, 2 MB/2,000-row cap enforced before upload, papaparse preview DataGrid with per-row Valid/Warning/Error + per-cell reason, batched POST in chunks of 200, post-import summary + error-report download.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/users/import/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-15\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-20\",\n      \"description\": \"/students/[studentId] header (avatar, name, admission number, grade level, status) + Overview tab (profile, family, emergency contact; medicalNotes shown only for ADMIN/TEACHER) registered in student-tabs.ts.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/students/[studentId]/page.tsx\", \"src/config/student-tabs.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-13\", \"TASK-7\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\", \"FR-25\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-21\",\n      \"description\": \"/my-children (PARENT only): cards (name, grade level, admission number) linking to the student detail page, EmptyState when none linked.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/my-children/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-22\",\n      \"description\": \"/account/profile: read-only name/email/role, editable phone (+occupation/address for PARENT) via PATCH /api/me/profile.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/account/profile/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-27\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-23\",\n      \"description\": \"Create/edit user flow: shared UserFormStepper (role select -> common + role-specific fields, inline parent/student linking via UserPicker, 'Send invitation email now' checkbox default checked), new/page.tsx and [id]/edit/page.tsx (role read-only on edit, email-change confirm dialog).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/new/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/[id]/edit/page.tsx\",\n        \"src/app/(app)/admin/users/UserFormStepper.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-8\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-4\", \"TASK-16\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 6,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-6\", \"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"FR-9\", \"FR-10\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-24\",\n      \"description\": \"/admin/audit-log: read-only table (time, actor, action, entityType, entityId linked when a user, IP) with actor/action-prefix/date-range filters, right Drawer with pretty-printed metadata JSON on row click.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/audit-log/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-29\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-25\",\n      \"description\": \"Add Users/Import users/Audit log (ADMIN) and My children (PARENT) entries to navigation.ts; wire shell.tsx's existing 'Profile' user-menu item to /account/profile (currently a dead button).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/config/navigation.ts\", \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-17\", \"TASK-19\", \"TASK-21\", \"TASK-22\", \"TASK-24\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-30\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-26\",\n      \"description\": \"Vitest unit tests: CSV row validator (TASK-4), admission/employee-number generator (TASK-6), escapeCsvCell/formula-injection escaping (TASK-2), getAccessibleStudentIds per role (TASK-7).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/unit/userValidators.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/userNumberGenerators.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/csv.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/studentAccess.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-4\", \"TASK-2\", \"TASK-6\", \"TASK-7\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-27\",\n      \"description\": \"Vitest integration tests: import batch rollback on a failing row within a 200-row batch, the last-active-admin / self-disable guard, and primary-link uniqueness (set-one-clears-others, max-4 rejection).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/unit/userImport.integration.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/users.integration.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/userLinks.integration.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-11\", \"TASK-15\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\", \"NFR-3\", \"FR-14\", \"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-28\",\n      \"description\": \"Playwright e2e: create a student with an inline-linked parent, CSV import happy path with one deliberately bad row, parent My-children -> student detail page navigation.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/e2e/user-management.spec.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-23\", \"TASK-19\", \"TASK-20\", \"TASK-21\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-6\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"fileStructure\": {\n    \"prisma/\": [\"schema.prisma\"],\n    \"public/templates/\": [\"students-template.csv\", \"teachers-template.csv\"],\n    \"src/lib/validators/\": [\"users.ts\"],\n    \"src/server/\": [\"csv.ts\", \"auth/student-access.ts\", \"services/users.ts\", \"services/userLinks.ts\", \"services/userImport.ts\"],\n    \"src/components/\": [\"UserPicker/\"],\n    \"src/config/\": [\"navigation.ts\", \"student-tabs.ts\"],\n    \"src/app/api/\": [\"users/\", \"students/\", \"me/\", \"audit-logs/\"],\n    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\"shell.tsx\", \"admin/users/\", \"admin/audit-log/\", \"students/\", \"my-children/\", \"account/profile/\"],\n    \"tests/\": [\"unit/\", \"e2e/\"]\n  },\n\n  \"totalEstimateHours\": 73,\n  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":7,"newStart":7,"newLines":8,"lines":["   \"notes\": [","     \"Sequencing dependency carried from architect (system-design.md Status / handoff-to-dev-planning.json blocker, advisory): PRD-01 (real auth/session) has not landed in src/ — only requireRole.ts's ADMIN placeholder and the relevant Prisma columns (User.lockedUntil/fa