{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CgBNaB3FT9QuQxGREkVLB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dev-planning phase for ticket **abcd-03** (PRD-03 User Management) is complete. Summary:\n\n**28 tasks, 73 estimated hours**, covering all 31 FRs / 18 endpoints from the architect's design — schema additions, 6 service/util modules, 14 API route files, 11 UI pages/components, and 3 test suites (unit/integration/e2e), in dependency order with no cycles.\n\nKey planning decisions:\n- Followed the architect's sequencing-dependency note: `sendInvite()` and lockout/unlock logic are built against PRD-01's committed interface names but stubbed behind `requireRole.ts`'s existing placeholder convention, so call sites won't change when PRD-01 lands.\n- `navigation.ts`/`shell.tsx` additions are flat (matching what actually exists today, not PRD-02's never-landed grouped sidebar) — avoids inventing UI infra out of scope.\n- NFR-5/7/8 are cross-cutting (reuse existing components/helpers, additive-only) rather than owned by one task, mirroring how system-design.md itself traced them.\n\nValidated: implementation-plan.json ↔ file-ownership-matrix.json file/task-id agreement is exact, all `requirementIds` resolve to real ids in `requirements.json`, dependency graph is acyclic, `ticketId` is `abcd-03` everywhere, and `totalEstimateHours` sums correctly.\n\nArtifacts written to `artifacts/dev-planning/`: `file-structure.md`, `module-dependencies.json`, `file-ownership-matrix.json`, `implementation-plan.json` (written last, per phase convention)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":132,"cache_read_input_tokens":111751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":132},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":nu