{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UkGhP6Qy3CKuyup3SYNEwS","type":"tool_result","content":"src/app/(app)\nsrc/app/(app)/dashboard\n---\n3:54-  email             String      @unique\n9:60-  status            UserStatus  @default(INVITED)\n14:65-  archivedAt        DateTime?\n51:117-/// emails; src/server/services/userLinks.ts is the only writer, enforcing\n69:135-/// (NFR-1) — the raw token exists only in the link emailed/logged to the\n87:153-/// non-existent email can still be recorded.\n--- full User model ---\ngenerator client {\n  provider = \"prisma-client-js\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n  url      = env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n}\n\nenum Role {\n  ADMIN\n  TEACHER\n  STUDENT\n  PARENT\n}\n\nenum UserStatus {\n  ACTIVE\n  INVITED\n  DISABLED\n  ARCHIVED\n}\n\nenum AuthTokenType {\n  INVITE\n  PASSWORD_RESET\n}\n\nenum Gender {\n  FEMALE\n  MALE\n  OTHER\n  UNDISCLOSED\n}\n\nenum GuardianRelationship {\n  MOTHER\n  FATHER\n  GUARDIAN\n  GRANDPARENT\n  OTHER\n}\n\n/// Every authenticated person. passwordHash is nullable because an INVITED\n/// user has no password until they accept their invite (TASK-8's\n/// acceptInvite step sets both passwordHash and status=ACTIVE together).\n/// phone and archivedAt are added here (PRD-03/TASK-1) because they are the\n/// only task in this PRD that owns schema.prisma: phone is FR-3's common\n/// field shared by every role, archivedAt backs FR-13's archive/restore\n/// (separate from status so a DISABLED-but-not-archived user stays distinct\n/// from an archived one).\nmodel User {\n  id                String      @id @default(cuid())\n  email             String      @unique\n  passwordHash      String?\n  firstName         String\n  lastName          String\n  phone             String?\n  role              Role\n  status            UserStatus  @default(INVITED)\n  failedLoginCount  Int         @default(0)\n  lockedUntil       DateTime?\n  lastLoginAt       DateTime?\n  passwordChangedAt DateTime?\n  archivedAt        DateTime?\n  createdAt         DateTime    @default(now())\n  updatedAt         DateTime    @updatedAt\n  authTokens        AuthToken[]\n  auditLogs         AuditLog[]\n  studentProfile    StudentProfile?\n  teacherProfile    TeacherProfile?\n  parentProfile     ParentProfile?\n  parentLinks       ParentStudentLink[] @relation(\"ParentLinks\")\n  studentLinks      ParentStudentLink[] @relation(\"StudentLinks\")\n\n  @@index([lastName, firstName, email])\n}\n\n/// Student-specific fields (FR-1). medicalNotes is visible to ADMIN/TEACHER\n/// only -- enforced in the service layer (src/server/services/users.ts,","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"21428f3c-ee64-490e-9dd6-6d268e3d5ec0","uuid":"ddc4ba21-bfbd-41a9-a591-e45c75afb674","timestamp":"2026-10-19T10:14:25.774Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"src/app/(app)\nsrc/app/(app)/dashboard\n---\n3:54-  email             String      @unique\n9:60-  status            UserStatus  @default(INVITED)\n14:65-  archivedAt        DateTime?\n51:117-/// emails; src/server/services/userLinks.ts is the only writer, enforcing\n69:135-/// (NFR-1) — the raw token exists only in the link emailed/logged to the\n87:153-/// non-existent email can still be recorded.\n--- full User model ---\ngenerator client {\n  provider = \"prisma-client-js\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n  url      = env(\"DATABASE_URL\")\n}\n\nenum Role {\n  ADMIN\n  TEACHER\n  STUDENT\n  PARENT\n}\n\nenum UserStatus {\n  ACTIVE\n  INVITED\n  DISABLED\n  ARCHIVED\n}\n\nenum AuthTokenType {\n  INVITE\n  PASSWORD_RESET\n}\n\nenum Gender {\n  FEMALE\n  MALE\n  OTHER\n  UNDISCLOSED\n}\n\nenum GuardianRelationship {\n  MOTHER\n  FATHER\n  GUARDIAN\n  GRANDPARENT\n  OTHER\n}\n\n/// Every authenticated person. passwordHash is nullable because an INVITED\n/// user has no password until they accept their invite (TASK-8's\n/// acceptInvite step sets both passwordHash and status=ACTIVE toge