{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CgCzJQGUGowjzB9oNJkgx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019wtRakqF8uAEJhiqEmvACc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/dev-planning/implementation-plan.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-04\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-20T11:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Add new runtime dependencies (nodemailer, @react-email/components, @react-email/render) to package.json, add SMTP_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SECURE, EMAIL_FROM, EMAIL_TRANSPORT and CRON_SECRET to .env.example and to src/lib/env.ts's zod schema (EMAIL_TRANSPORT defaults to 'console').\",\n      \"files\": [\"package.json\", \".env.example\", \"src/lib/env.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-2\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/schema.prisma with the Notification and NotificationPreference models, the EmailOutbox model, and the EmailStatus enum (PENDING/SENDING/SENT/FAILED), including the Notification(userId, readAt, createdAt) composite index and EmailOutbox(status, nextAttemptAt) index. Run `npm run db:migrate` to generate the migration.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/schema.prisma\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-3\",\n      \"description\": \"Export the existing ALL_ROLES const from src/config/navigation.ts (currently local/unexported) so route handlers can import it, and append two NavItem entries: 'Notifications' (/notifications, ALL_ROLES) and 'Email log' (/admin/email-log, ADMIN only) to the existing flat navigation array.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/config/navigation.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-23\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-4\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/notifications/types.ts exporting NOTIFICATION_TYPES (key -> label/description/category/defaultEmail/mandatoryInApp/roles) across ACCOUNT/ACADEMIC/ATTENDANCE/COMMUNICATION/FINANCE/SYSTEM categories, seeded with account.invite, account.password_reset, system.test; export the key union via keyof typeof NOTIFICATION_TYPES.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/notifications/types.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-2\", \"FR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-5\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/notifications/notify.ts: notify({ type, userIds, title, body?, link?, email? }) typed against TASK-4's registry keys, filtering archived/disabled users, resolving per-user NotificationPreference (falling back to registry defaults), batching Notification and EmailOutbox inserts via createMany (<=3 round trips per 1,000 recipients), never throwing to the caller (log only), validating link is '/'-prefixed. Co-locate notifyStudentAndParents({ studentIds, ...rest }) which expands each student id to itself plus linked parent ids via the existing ParentStudentLink table, dedupes, and calls notify() once.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/notifications/notify.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-4\", \"FR-5\", \"FR-6\", \"NFR-2\", \"NFR-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-6\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the email template set under src/server/email/templates/ using @react-email/components: BaseLayout.tsx (logo/name header, content slot, footer with school address, 'Manage email preferences' link to /account/notifications, required disclosure sentence), plus invite.tsx, password-reset.tsx and generic-notification.tsx built on BaseLayout. Plain React components only (no MUI, no 'use client').\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/server/email/templates/BaseLayout.tsx\",\n        \"src/server/email/templates/invite.tsx\",\n        \"src/server/email/templates/password-reset.tsx\",\n        \"src/server/email/templates/generic-notification.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\", \"FR-8\", \"NFR-5\", \"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-7\",\n      \"description\": \"Add an overrides block to .eslintrc.json scoping src/server/email/templates/** as the one exemption glob so @react-email/components imports there are not flagged by the MUI-only no-restricted-imports rule, while every other path stays MUI-only.\",\n      \"files\": [\".eslintrc.json\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-6\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 0.5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-8\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/email/transport.ts exporting sendMail(), switching on EMAIL_TRANSPORT: 'smtp' builds a real nodemailer.createTransport from SMTP_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SECURE and EMAIL_FROM; 'console' (default) logs subject/recipient/text and returns success. Every send sets the List-Unsubscribe header pointing at /account/notifications.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/email/transport.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-13\", \"NFR-6\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-9\",\n      \"description\": \"Replace the logging-only body of sendInvite(userId) in src/server/services/users.ts with a real implementation (sendAuthEmail) that looks up the user, renders TASK-6's invite/password-reset template, and inserts one EmailOutbox row directly (bypassing notify() -- auth emails are not preference-gated). Preserve the exact exported signature (userId) => Promise<{ id, inviteSentAt }> so PRD-03's call sites (POST /api/users/:id/invite, create-user checkbox) are untouched.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/services/users.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-6\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-9\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-10\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/notifications/purge.ts exporting purgeOldNotifications(), a plain function deleting Notification rows with createdAt older than 180 days.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/notifications/purge.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-17\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-11\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/email/dispatcher.ts exporting dispatchEmails({ batchSize = 50 }): (a) recovers rows stuck in SENDING for >10 min back to PENDING; (b) a prisma.$transaction running `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` to claim up to batchSize PENDING rows with nextAttemptAt <= now, flips them to SENDING; (c) outside the lock, sends each via TASK-8's transport, marks SENT/sentAt on success or applies the 1/5/15/60/240-minute backoff (FAILED after the 5th attempt) on failure; (d) once per calendar day (in-memory last-run check), calls TASK-10's purgeOldNotifications(). Returns { sent, failed, retried }.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/email/dispatcher.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-8\", \"TASK-10\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-10\", \"FR-11\", \"FR-17\", \"NFR-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-12\",\n      \"description\": \"Create POST /api/internal/email/dispatch (src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts) checking `Authorization: Bearer ${CRON_SECRET}` directly (401 via the standard error envelope on mismatch, not requireRole), calling TASK-11's dispatchEmails({ batchSize }) and returning its result. Create scripts/worker-email.ts, a tsx script looping dispatchEmails() every 15s (matches the existing db:seed tsx-script pattern). Add a `worker:email` script to package.json.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/route.ts\", \"scripts/worker-email.ts\", \"package.json\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-11\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-12\", \"NFR-8\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-13\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/server/notifications/list.ts exporting listNotifications({ userId, unread?, category?, page, pageSize }) (own-rows-only, joined with registry metadata), getUnreadCount(userId) (relies on TASK-2's composite index for the <50ms budget), markRead(userId, id), markUnread(userId, id), markAllRead(userId) -- one implementation backing both the popover and the /notifications page.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/server/notifications/list.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"NFR-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-14\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the 5 user-facing notification routes on top of TASK-13: GET /api/notifications (?unread=&category=&page=&pageSize=), GET /api/notifications/unread-count, POST /api/notifications/:id/read, POST /api/notifications/:id/unread, POST /api/notifications/read-all. Every route calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (TASK-3's export) as the stand-in for PRD-01's not-yet-landed requireUser(), scopes to the caller's own rows, and uses src/server/http.ts's ok/paginated/apiError conventions. Owner-only routes return NOT_FOUND (never reveal another user's row) when the id doesn't belong to the caller.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/notifications/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/notifications/unread-count/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/notifications/[id]/read/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/notifications/[id]/unread/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/notifications/read-all/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\", \"TASK-13\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-15\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/app/api/me/notification-preferences/route.ts: GET returns the caller's NotificationPreference rows merged with TASK-4's registry defaults for every type visible to the caller's role; PUT upserts one {type, inApp, email} row, rejecting inApp=false for mandatoryInApp types with VALIDATION_ERROR. Calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (TASK-3's export).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/me/notification-preferences/route.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 2,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-16\",\n      \"description\": \"Create the 3 ADMIN-only routes: GET /api/admin/email-log (paginated EmailOutbox rows, status filter), POST /api/admin/email-log/:id/retry (resets attempts=0, status=PENDING, nextAttemptAt=now -- picked up by TASK-11's dispatcher), POST /api/admin/notifications/test (calls notify({ type: 'system.test', userIds: [caller.id] })). All three call requireRole('ADMIN') directly (already real today).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/api/admin/email-log/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/admin/email-log/[id]/retry/route.ts\",\n        \"src/app/api/admin/notifications/test/route.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-5\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-7\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-17\",\n      \"description\": \"Replace the static `Badge badgeContent={0}` bell in src/app/(app)/shell.tsx (~line 141) with a live MUI IconButton+Badge driven by a new useUnreadCount() hook (src/hooks/useUnreadCount.ts: fetch + setInterval(30_000), paused on document.visibilitState === 'hidden' via a visibilitychange listener, '9+' cap above 9) and a new NotificationBell component (src/components/NotificationBell/NotificationBell.tsx: opens an MUI Popover with a List of the 10 most recent notifications from GET /api/notifications?pageSize=10, unread bold+dot, 2-line-clamped body, relative time; click marks read via POST .../read and navigates to link; footer 'Mark all as read' / 'View all').\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/app/(app)/shell.tsx\",\n        \"src/hooks/useUnreadCount.ts\",\n        \"src/components/NotificationBell/NotificationBell.tsx\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 4,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-15\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-18\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/app/(app)/notifications/page.tsx: paginated (20/page) MUI List/Table over GET /api/notifications, All/Unread Tabs, category filter, bulk 'Mark all as read' (POST /api/notifications/read-all), per-row read/unread toggle.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/notifications/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-14\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-16\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-19\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/app/(app)/account/notifications/page.tsx: MUI Table grouped by category (ListSubheader rows) over GET /api/me/notification-preferences filtered to the caller's role, each row an In-app Switch + Email Switch (mandatoryInApp types render a disabled Switch + Tooltip 'Required by the school'); toggles optimistically call PUT /api/me/notification-preferences with rollback on a non-2xx response.\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/account/notifications/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-15\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-19\", \"FR-22\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-20\",\n      \"description\": \"Create src/app/(app)/admin/email-log/page.tsx: table over GET /api/admin/email-log (created/recipient/subject/status/attempts/lastError), status filter, 'Retry now' row action (POST .../retry), 'Send test notification to me' button (POST /api/admin/notifications/test).\",\n      \"files\": [\"src/app/(app)/admin/email-log/page.tsx\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-16\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-20\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-21\",\n      \"description\": \"Extend prisma/seed.ts with 3 system.test Notification rows (1 read, 2 unread) for student@schoolhub.test and parent@schoolhub.test, linking to /dashboard, upserted idempotently like the rest of the seed script.\",\n      \"files\": [\"prisma/seed.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-2\", \"TASK-4\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 1,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-24\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-22\",\n      \"description\": \"Add Vitest unit/integration coverage under tests/unit/: notification-types.test.ts (compile-time key rejection via a type-level test against TASK-4's registry), notify.test.ts (notify() batching round-trip count and never-throw contract against TASK-5), dispatcher.test.ts (claim-and-send with a concurrent-dispatcher race, stuck-row recovery, retry-backoff schedule math against TASK-11), link-validator.test.ts (notify()'s '/'-prefixed link validation), notification-preferences.test.ts (server-side mandatory-preference rejection against TASK-15).\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/unit/notification-types.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/notify.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/dispatcher.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/link-validator.test.ts\",\n        \"tests/unit/notification-preferences.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-4\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-11\", \"TASK-15\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 5,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-9\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-23\",\n      \"description\": \"Add a Playwright e2e spec (tests/e2e/notifications.spec.ts) covering: bell unread count updates after a notify() call, mark-all-read, preferences toggle persists across reload, admin retry-now, admin test-send.\",\n      \"files\": [\"tests/e2e/notifications.spec.ts\"],\n      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-17\", \"TASK-18\", \"TASK-19\", \"TASK-20\"],\n      \"estimateHours\": 3,\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-9\"]\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"fileStructure\": {\n    \"prisma/\": [\"schema.prisma\", \"seed.ts\"],\n    \"scripts/\": [\"worker-email.ts\"],\n    \"src/lib/\": [\"env.ts\"],\n    \"src/config/\": [\"navigation.ts\"],\n    \"src/server/notifications/\": [\"types.ts\", \"notify.ts\", \"list.ts\", \"purge.ts\"],\n    \"src/server/email/\": [\"transport.ts\", \"dispatcher.ts\", \"templates/\"],\n    \"src/server/email/templates/\": [\"BaseLayout.tsx\", \"invite.tsx\", \"password-reset.tsx\", \"generic-notification.tsx\"],\n    \"src/server/services/\": [\"users.ts\"],\n    \"src/app/api/notifications/\": [\"route.ts\", \"unread-count/\", \"[id]/\", \"read-all/\"],\n    \"src/app/api/me/notification-preferences/\": [\"route.ts\"],\n    \"src/app/api/internal/email/dispatch/\": [\"route.ts\"],\n    \"src/app/api/admin/\": [\"email-log/\", \"notifications/test/\"],\n    \"src/app/(app)/\": [\"shell.tsx\", \"notifications/\", \"account/notifications/\", \"admin/email-log/\"],\n    \"src/hooks/\": [\"useUnreadCount.ts\"],\n    \"src/components/NotificationBell/\": [\"NotificationBell.tsx\"],\n    \"tests/unit/\": [\"notification-types.test.ts\", \"notify.test.ts\", \"dispatcher.test.ts\", \"link-validator.test.ts\", \"notification-preferences.test.ts\"],\n    \"tests/e2e/\": [\"notifications.spec.ts\"]\n  },\n\n  \"totalEstimateHours\": 59.5,\n  \"nxpPatterns\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2218,"cache_read_input_tokens":88130,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2218},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","in