ren for My Children) and PATCH /api/me/profile (self only; phone + occupation/address for PARENT; name/email/role read-only here).\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/me/children/route.ts\", \"src/app/api/me/profile/route.ts\"],","-      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-1\", \"TASK-5\", \"TASK-4\"],","-      \"estimateHours\": 1.5,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-26\", \"FR-27\"]","+      \"description\": \"Create the 5 user-facing notification routes on top of TASK-13: GET /api/notifications (?unread=&category=&page=&pageSize=), GET /api/notifications/unread-count, POST /api/notifications/:id/read, POST /api/notifications/:id/unread, POST /api/notifications/read-all. Every route calls requireRole(...ALL_ROLES) (TASK-3's export) as the stand-in for PRD-01's not-yet-landed requireUser(), scopes to the caller's own rows, and uses src/server/http.ts's ok/paginated/apiError conventions. Owner-only routes return NOT_FOUND (never reveal another user's row) when the id doesn't belong to the caller.\",","+      \"files\": [","+        \"src/app/api/notifications/route.ts\",","+        \"src/app/api/notifications/unread-count/route.ts\",","+        \"src/app/api/notifications/[id]/read/route.ts\",","+        \"src/app/api/notifications/[id]/unread/route.ts\",","+        \"src/app/api/notifications/read-all/route.ts\"","+      ],","+      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-3\", \"TASK-13\"],","+      \"estimateHours\": 4,","+      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-14\", \"FR-15\", \"FR-16\", \"FR-21\", \"NFR-3\", \"NFR-7\"]","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"TASK-15\",","-      \"description\": \"POST /api/users/import: accepts type+rows+sendInvites, calls TASK-11's batch transaction, returns summary + per-row results + error-report CSV URL via TASK-2's csv util.\",","-      \"files\": [\"src/app/api/users/import/route.ts\"],","-      \"dependencies\": [\"TASK-11\", \"TASK-2\"],","-      \"estimateHours\": 2.5,","-      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-18\", \"FR-20\", \"FR-21\", \"FR-22\", \"FR-23