{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgT4nUqryrwV4ATWVVGqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015Bw5T2ZnvPYAzzKELcKJLS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/dev-planning/file-structure.md","content":"# File Structure — ticket abcd-05 (PRD-05 Classes & Enrollment)\n\nPhase: dev-planning | Brownfield delta only. `+` = CREATE, `~` = MODIFY.\nNo DELETE operations. No new dependencies (tech-stack-decisions \"Summary\").\n\n```\nprisma/\n  ~ schema.prisma                         # TASK-1  Section, SectionMember, Course, Enrollment, CourseKind, EnrollmentStatus (+ back-relations on User/AcademicYear/GradeLevel/Subject/Room)\n  migrations/\n    + 20261027000000_classes_enrollment/\n        + migration.sql                   # TASK-1\n\nsrc/\n  lib/validators/\n    + sections.ts                         # TASK-2  section input, members/enroll, move-section, core-courses, copy-to-year\n    + courses.ts                          # TASK-2  course input (+ CORE⇒section refinement, shared by dialog + API), enrollment status, list queries\n  server/\n    enrollment/\n      + roster-engine.ts                  # TASK-3  checkCapacityOrThrow, enrollSectionCoreCourses, dropSectionCoreCourses, moveStudentSection\n    auth/\n      + course-access.ts                  # TASK-5  assertCanViewCourse, assertCanManageCourse\n      ~ student-access.ts                 # TASK-5  TEACHER branch of getAccessibleStudentIds\n    sections/\n      + sections-service.ts               # TASK-6\n    courses/\n      + courses-service.ts                # TASK-7  incl. getCourseRoster (NFR-4 projection), createCoreCourses, listMyCourses, getStudentCourses\n  config/\n    ~ navigation.ts                       # TASK-10 NavItem.group + My courses / Sections / Courses\n    + course-tabs.ts                      # TASK-15\n    ~ student-tabs.ts                     # TASK-17 \"Courses\" tab\n  app/\n    (app)/\n      ~ shell.tsx                         # TASK-10 group subheaders\n      admin/\n        sections/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-11\n          + SectionsClient.tsx            # TASK-11\n          [id]/\n            + page.tsx                    # TASK-12\n            + SectionDetailClient.tsx     # TASK-12\n        courses/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-13\n          + CoursesClient.tsx             # TASK-13\n          [id]/enrollment/\n            + page.tsx                    # TASK-14\n            + EnrollmentClient.tsx        # TASK-14\n      courses/[courseId]/\n        + layout.tsx                      # TASK-15 header (colour band, name, code, teachers, section, room) + tabs\n        + CourseTabs.tsx                  # TASK-15 client MUI Tabs driven by course-tabs.ts\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-15 Overview tab\n        roster/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-15 Roster tab\n      my-courses/\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-16\n      students/[id]/courses/\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-17\n    api/\n      sections/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-8  GET, POST\n        copy-to-year/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-8  POST\n        [id]/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-8  PATCH, DELETE\n          members/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-8  POST\n            [studentId]/\n              + route.ts                  # TASK-8  DELETE\n          core-courses/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-8  POST\n      students/[id]/move-section/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-8  POST\n      courses/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  GET, POST\n        [id]/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-9  GET, PATCH\n          roster/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-9  GET\n          enrollments/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-9  POST\n      enrollments/[id]/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  PATCH\n      me/courses/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  GET\n\ntests/\n  unit/\n    + roster-engine.test.ts               # TASK-4\n    + course-validators.test.ts           # TASK-18\n    + course-access.test.ts               # TASK-18\n  e2e/\n    + classes-enrollment.spec.ts          # TASK-19\n```\n\n## Notes for Dev\n\n- Service paths follow system-design.md exactly (`src/server/enrollment/`,\n  `src/server/sections/`, `src/server/courses/`), not the older\n  `src/server/services/` folder.\n- Add-student picker on `/admin/sections/[id]`: eligible students (section's\n  grade level, no section this year, role STUDENT) are computed server-side\n  by `sections-service` and passed to a plain MUI `Autocomplete multiple` —\n  no new search endpoint (api-contracts defines none) and no `UserPicker`\n  change. Teacher pickers reuse `UserPicker role=\"TEACHER\"` unchanged.\n- `audit()` (src/server/audit.ts) is reused unchanged; services/engine call\n  it per logical mutation, routes never do.\n- `/students/[id]/courses` is the only student-detail page so far (the\n  student page itself doesn't exist yet); it's the href registered by the\n  \"Courses\" tab and is gated with the existing `assertCanViewStudent`.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5550,"cache_read_input_tokens":63965,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5550},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"663c6c96-740a-404e-b9ed-7275dd3841b6","uuid":"7548d954-f0aa-4bf4-83d6-26db7e7dab8f","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:35:31.3