      sections/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-11\n          + SectionsClient.tsx            # TASK-11\n          [id]/\n            + page.tsx                    # TASK-12\n            + SectionDetailClient.tsx     # TASK-12\n        courses/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-13\n          + CoursesClient.tsx             # TASK-13\n          [id]/enrollment/\n            + page.tsx                    # TASK-14\n            + EnrollmentClient.tsx        # TASK-14\n      courses/[courseId]/\n        + layout.tsx                      # TASK-15 header (colour band, name, code, teachers, section, room) + tabs\n        + CourseTabs.tsx                  # TASK-15 client MUI Tabs driven by course-tabs.ts\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-15 Overview tab\n        roster/\n          + page.tsx                      # TASK-15 Roster tab\n      my-courses/\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-16\n      students/[id]/courses/\n        + page.tsx                        # TASK-17\n    api/\n      sections/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-8  GET, POST\n        copy-to-year/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-8  POST\n        [id]/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-8  PATCH, DELETE\n          members/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-8  POST\n            [studentId]/\n              + route.ts                  # TASK-8  DELETE\n          core-courses/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-8  POST\n      students/[id]/move-section/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-8  POST\n      courses/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  GET, POST\n        [id]/\n          + route.ts                      # TASK-9  GET, PATCH\n          roster/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-9  GET\n          enrollments/\n            + route.ts                    # TASK-9  POST\n      enrollments/[id]/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  PATCH\n      me/courses/\n        + route.ts                        # TASK-9  GET\n\ntests/\n  unit/\n    + roster-engine.test.ts               # TASK-4\n    + course-validators.test.ts           # TASK-18\n    + course-access.test.ts               # TASK-18\n  e2e/\n    + classes-enrollment.spec.ts          # TASK-19\n```\n\n## Notes for Dev\n\n- Service paths follow system-design.md exactly (`src/server/enrollment/`,\n  `src/server/sections/`, `src/server/courses/`), not the older\n  `src/server/services/` folder.\n- Add-student picker on `/admin/sections/[id]`: eligible students (section's\n  grade level, no section this year, role STUDENT) are computed server-side\n  by `sections-service` and passed to a plain MUI `Autocomplete multiple` —\n  no new search endpoint (api-contracts defines none) and no `UserPicker`\n  change. Teacher pickers reuse `UserPicker role=\"TEACHER\"` unchanged.\n- `audit()` (src/server/audit.ts) is reused unchanged; services/engine call\n  it per logical mutation, routes never do.\n- `/students/[id]/courses` is the only student-detail page so far (the\n  student page itself doesn't exist yet); it's the href registered by the\n  \"Courses\" tab and is gated with the existing `assertCanViewStudent`.\n"}}}
