r/auth/course-access.ts\",\"src/server/auth/student-access.ts\"], [\"TASK-1\"], 2, [\"FR-18\",\"FR-22\",\"NFR-7\"]),\n (\"Sections service: listSections (year defaults to getCurrentAcademicYear; memberCount, courseCount, sort/q/page), getSection, createSection/updateSection (homeroom-teacher-once-per-year findFirst inside the write $transaction per Decision 3; capacity >= memberCount on update), deleteSection (CONFLICT if members or courses), listEligibleStudents(sectionId) (STUDENT, same grade level, no SectionMember this year — feeds the add picker), addMembers (tx: section capacity check, SectionMember createMany, map P2002 to friendly CONFLICT, enrollSectionCoreCourses), removeMember (tx: delete + dropSectionCoreCourses), moveStudent (one tx: remove + moveStudentSection; validates same year, different section), copySectionsToYear (structural Section copy, grade advanced by GradeLevel.order, top grade / name clashes reported in `skipped`, target must be future non-current year). All writes audit section.* / enrollment.*.\",\n  [\"src/server/sections/sections-service.ts\"], [\"TASK-2\",\"TASK-3\"], 3.5, [\"FR-2\",\"FR-3\",\"FR-4\",\"FR-6\",\"FR-7\",\"FR-8\",\"FR-9\",\"FR-11\",\"FR-12\",\"FR-24\",\"NFR-2\",\"NFR-6\"]),\n (\"Courses service: listCourses (filters per api-contracts; ADMIN all, TEACHER taught/co-taught, STUDENT/PARENT ACTIVE enrollment of self/child; excludes archived unless includeArchived; enrolledCount ACTIVE only), getCourse, createCourse (tx; CORE -> enrollSectionCoreCourses with current section members, FR-10), createCoreCourses(sectionId, items) (tx; default name '<Subject> – <Section>', code '<SUBJECTCODE>-<SECTION>', non-archived subjects only, then enroll members per course), updateCourse (immutable academicYearId/sectionId/kind, archive/unarchive, capacity >= enrolledCount), getCourseRoster(courseId, viewerRole, query) (STUDENT projection = names only, ACTIVE only — NFR-4, single implementation shared by Roster tab + API), enrollStudentsInCo