{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgT4vAjAQnJKykdpEyXtE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev-planning phase for abcd-05 is done. All four artifacts are in `artifacts/dev-planning/`, and `implementation-plan.json` was written last with `status: \"complete\"`. That folder still held the abcd-04 artifacts, and all four have been overwritten with abcd-05 versions.\n\n**The plan:** 19 tasks covering 44 files (39 new, 5 modified), estimated at 45.5 hours in total. Every FR and NFR from intake is covered by at least one task. I checked the plan with a script before writing it:\n- Every requirement id cited exists in `requirements.json`.\n- Tasks only depend on earlier-numbered tasks, so there are no cycles.\n- No file is assigned to two tasks.\n- Files marked as new don't exist yet, and the 5 files marked as modified do exist.\n- `implementation-plan.json` and `file-ownership-matrix.json` are generated from the same task list, so their paths match exactly.\n\n**Task order:**\n1. **Foundation:** the database schema and migration (TASK-1) and the shared input validators (TASK-2).\n2. **Core logic:** the roster enrollment engine (TASK-3) and course/teacher access checks (TASK-5).\n3. **Services:** the sections service (TASK-6) and courses service (TASK-7).\n4. **API routes:** section routes (TASK-8) and course routes (TASK-9).\n5. **Screens:** the four admin pages (TASK-11 to 14), the course home page and tabs (TASK-15), My courses (TASK-16) and the student Courses tab (TASK-17).\n6. **Tests and nav:** unit and end-to-end tests (TASK-4, 18, 19) and sidebar navigation grouping (TASK-10).\n\n**Choices I made where the inputs didn't decide:**\n- **Service location:** service files go where the system design says (`src/server/enrollment/`, `src/server/sections/`, `src/server/courses/`), not the older `src/server/services/` folder.\n- **Add-students picker:** the server works out which students are eligible and passes them to a plain MUI multi-select. There's no new search endpoint (the API contracts don't define one) and no change to `UserPicker`.\n- **Student courses page:** I planned a `/students/[id]/courses` page because the student detail page doesn't exist yet. Otherwise the new \"Courses\" tab would link to a 404.\n- **Migration name:** the migration path is fixed as `prisma/migrations/20261027000000_classes_enrollment/`. Dev needs to rename the folder Prisma generates to match, because later checks compare against these exact paths.\n- **Audit logging:** `audit()` is reused as it is. It writes through its own connection rather than the transaction, and it never throws."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":542,"cache_read_input_tokens":82459,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":542},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"663c6c96-740a-404e-b9ed-7275dd3841b6","uuid":"6d6e3838-f5fe-4add-bb50-e8b2edd2cb2e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T16:36:50.119Z","request_id":"req_011CgT4vARZUJ5yS12NjCwFg"}
