e the folder Prisma generates to match, because later checks compare against these exact paths.\n- **Audit logging:** `audit()` is reused as it is. It writes through its own connection rather than the transaction, and it never throws.","ttft_ms":1344,"type":"result","duration_ms":155638,"uuid":"383ede85-60a0-44b4-bbb0-d8d89572df15","ttft_stream_ms":894,"time_to_request_ms":156,"first_content_frame_ms":895,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":17894,"cacheReadInputTokens":488315,"cacheCreationInputTokens":73046,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.0399909999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":4645,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":73046,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
