{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019FoMB3k4skybu6FrVoqYGX","type":"tool_result","content":"architect:\ntotal 176\ndrwxr-xr-x  8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  4 11:40 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  13580 Nov  4 11:40 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   1152 Nov  4 11:40 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  17106 Nov  4 11:35 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  30533 Nov  4 11:39 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  11861 Nov  4 11:35 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff    340 Nov  4 11:40 threat-model-notes.json\n\ndev:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 ikramaansari  staff   96 Oct 16 20:37 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff  224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  152 Oct 27 21:53 dev-rerun-count.json\n\ndev-planning:\ntotal 88\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Oct 27 21:35 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   5595 Oct 27 21:36 file-ownership-matrix.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   4948 Oct 27 21:35 file-structure.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  21122 Oct 27 21:36 implementation-plan.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   2622 Oct 27 21:35 module-dependencies.json\n\nintake:\ntotal 72\ndrwxr-xr-x  6 ikramaansari  staff    192 Nov  4 11:34 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  7 ikramaansari  staff    224 Oct 16 20:20 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   1048 Nov  4 11:34 handoff-to-architect.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff  17516 Nov  4 11:33 requirements.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff    650 Nov  4 11:33 tech-stack.json\n-rw-r--r--  1 ikramaansari  staff   5349 Nov  4 11:33 user-stories.md\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T17:00:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev-planning\",\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TASK-1\",\n      \"description\": \"Prisma data layer: add enums CourseKind (CORE/ELECTIVE), EnrollmentStatus (ACTIVE/DROPPED) and models Section, SectionMember, Course (incl. coTeachers many-to-many to User, archivedAt), Enrollment exactly per FR-1 with @@unique([academicYearId,name]) on Section, @@unique([studentId,academicYearId]) on SectionMember, @@unique([academicYearId,code]) on Course, @@unique([courseId,studentId]) + @@index([studentId,status]) on\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-05\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T16:53:55.011Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"dev\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"count\": 3,\n  \"firstPassAccepted\": false\n}{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-1\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T00:04:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 8,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"8 endpoints: 4 Auth.js protocol endpoints served by the single /api/auth/[...nextauth] route file, plus 4 custom route files (accept-invite, forgot-password, reset-password, account/password).\",\n    \"Intake blockers FR-1, FR-25 and FR-28/29 were resolved in system-design.md (additive migration, keep the existing users.ts signatures, async requireRole with 50 awaited call sites in 43 files).\",\n    \"The existing 33 route handlers keep their paths and shapes but gain 401/403 responses (see changedBehaviourOnExistingEndpoints).\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-6 (carried forward, not blocking dev-planning): Dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs/fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and stop and report it if not.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\ndd8bf49 cursor: empty commit to allow worktree creation\n?? ../../../.CFUserTextEncoding\n?? ../../../.anaconda/\n?? ../../../.a