{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghS5FTvKjxf8GVBDuUk6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ViyncTiBFdV1sMw7sJFrM3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/abcd1-plan && cat > /tmp/abcd1-plan/gen.py <<'EOF'\nimport json, sys, os\nroot = sys.argv[1]\nTS = \"2026-11-04T12:00:00Z\"\nTID = \"abcd-1\"\nC, M = \"CREATE\", \"MODIFY\"\nroutesA = [\"src/app/api/academic-years/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/set-current/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/academic-years/[id]/terms/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/audit-logs/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/courses/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/courses/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/courses/[id]/enrollments/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/courses/[id]/roster/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/enrollments/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/me/children/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/me/courses/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/me/profile/route.ts\"]\nroutesB = [\"src/app/api/sections/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/sections/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/sections/[id]/core-courses/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/sections/[id]/members/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/sections/[id]/members/[studentId]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/sections/copy-to-year/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/students/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/students/[id]/move-section/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/students/[id]/parents/[parentId]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/archive/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/invite/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/restore/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/status/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/[id]/unlock/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/export/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/import/route.ts\",\"src/app/api/users/search/route.ts\"]\npages = [\"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/admin/courses/[id]/enrollment/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/admin/sections/[id]/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/layout.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/roster/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/my-courses/page.tsx\",\"src/app/(app)/students/[id]/courses/page.tsx\"]\nassert len(routesA)+len(routesB)==33 and len(pages)==8\nfor p in routesA+routesB+pages: assert os.path.exists(os.path.join(root,p)), p\n\nT = []\ndef t(desc, files, deps, est, reqs): T.append(dict(id=f\"TASK-{len(T)+1}\", description=desc, files=files, dependencies=deps, estimateHours=est, requirementIds=reqs))\n\nt(\"Additive schema reconcile (ADR-9, C1): add @@index([entityType, entityId]) and @@index([actorId, createdAt]) to AuditLog in prisma/schema.prisma. No renames or drops: keep AuditLog.ip, UserStatus.ARCHIVED and the existing indexes. Generate the migration with `prisma migrate dev --name auth_reconcile` and rename its folder to exactly 20261104000000_auth_reconcile so the path matches this plan. The SQL must contain only CREATE INDEX statements.\",\n  [(C,\"prisma/migrations/20261104000000_auth_reconcile/migration.sql\"),(M,\"prisma/schema.prisma\")], [], 0.5, [\"FR-1\",\"NFR-9\",\"NFR-12\"])\nt(\"Client-safe validators (C6): emailField = z.string().trim().toLowerCase().email(). Also signInSchema, forgotPasswordSchema, acceptInviteSchema/resetPasswordSchema {token,password,confirm}, and changePasswordSchema {currentPassword,newPassword,confirm} with confirm-equals refines. passwordChecks(pw, email) returns {length (10-128), letter, digit, notEmail}, and the schemas' superRefine uses it. safeCallbackUrl(url) returns url only if it starts with '/' and not '//' or '/\\\\\\\\'; otherwise '/dashboard'. No fs import. Unit tests cover passwordChecks and safeCallbackUrl, including '//evil.com', '/\\\\\\\\evil', 'https://evil.com', '' and null.\",\n  [(C,\"src/lib/validators/auth.ts\"),(C,\"tests/unit/auth-validators.test.ts\")], [], 1.5, [\"FR-2\",\"FR-8\",\"FR-17\",\"FR-36\",\"NFR-8\"])\nt(\"Auth email seam (C9): send