the database index change, input validation, the email logging stub, the rate limiter, the audit log changes and the invite/reset token module.\n- **Sign-in core (TASK-7–11):** password checking with lockout, the Auth.js setup, the password rules, the middleware that blocks signed-out requests, and the rewritten `requireRole`.\n- **Updating existing callers (TASK-12–15):** the 41 files that call `requireRole` are split into 13 API routes, 20 API routes and 8 pages. A lint rule then catches any `await` that was missed.\n- **New features (TASK-16–24):** the auth services and their API routes, the `users.ts` invite changes, and the shared password form. Also the login, forgot-password, invite and reset pages, the app shell, the account security page and the seed data.\n- **Tests (TASK-25–26):** integration tests and Playwright tests.\n\nEvery one of the 37 functional and 12 non-functional requirements is assigned to at least one task. One script built both the plan and the ownership matrix and checked them: they list the same files under the same tasks, and the task order has no cycles. Every requirement ID exists in `requirements.json`. Files marked \"modify\" exist on disk, and files marked \"create\" don't yet. I took the 41 `requireRole` call sites from the actual code, not from the architect's count.\n\n**Choices I made that differ from or add to the design:**\n- **Email links use the existing `APP_URL` setting.** The design says `AUTH_URL`, which doesn't exist in `src/lib/env.ts`, so this avoids adding a new setting.\n- **The migration folder has a fixed name, `prisma/migrations/20261104000000_auth_reconcile/`.** Later checks compare against exact paths, so Dev has to rename Prisma's generated folder to match.\n- **`tests/e2e/dashboard.spec.ts` must change.** Signed-out visitors to `/dashboard` will now be sent to the login page, which would otherwise break this existing test.\n- **Integration tests need a running Postgres and an edit to `vitest.config.ts`.** Right now the test runner only picks up `tests/unit`.\n\n**Things Dev should know:**\n- Typecheck will fail after TASK-11 (the `requireRole` rewrite) until TASK-12–14 update the callers, so those should run straight after it.\n- The seed script will now load the app's environment checks, so `npm run db:seed` has to load `.env` first.\n- Dev still has to confirm the MUI docs server (mui-mcp) is reachable before writing any UI, and stop if it isn't.","ttft_ms":3645,"type":"result","duration_ms":206621,"uuid":"7b4a2a3d-177d-49cc-b1f9-6c4481c5f58b","ttft_stream_ms":2603,"time_to_request_ms":103,"first_content_frame_ms":2603,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":22909,"cacheReadInputTokens":669629,"cacheCreationInputTokens":82657,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.2534578,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":5101,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":82657,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
