{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018yTugWo56TXGa87cN74beN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-4\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T12:31:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 11,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"11 endpoints in 9 route files: 5 user notification endpoints, GET/PUT for preferences, 3 ADMIN endpoints and 1 CRON_SECRET-gated internal dispatch endpoint. All of them sit under /api with no /v1 and reuse the ok/paginated/apiError envelopes from src/server/http.ts. No new error codes.\",\n    \"Intake blockers FR-1, FR-4/FR-16 and FR-40 are resolved in system-design.md: one additive migration, sendAuthEmail enqueues directly and still throws, and the seed creates 3 per user and skips users that are missing.\",\n    \"New finding B1: '/api/internal/' must be added to PUBLIC_API_PATHS, otherwise the middleware returns 401 to cron before the dispatch handler runs.\",\n    \"Earlier dev-planning artifacts on disk belong to ticket abcd-1 and must be regenerated for SH-4.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [\n    \"NFR-10 (carried forward, does not block dev-planning): dev must confirm mui-mcp (useMuiDocs, then fetchDocs) is reachable before writing UI, and must stop and report if it is not.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-4\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-04T12:30:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"conventions\": {\n    \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention, no /api/v1 prefix; NFR-13 forbids renaming routes)\",\n    \"successEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\" },\n    \"paginatedEnvelope\": { \"data\": \"<item[]>\", \"meta\": { \"page\": \"number\", \"pageSize\": \"number\", \"total\": \"number\" } },\n    \"errorEnvelope\": { \"error\": { \"code\": \"string\", \"message\": \"string\", \"details\": \"unknown?\" } },\n    \"errorCodes\": {\n      \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n      \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n      \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n      \"NOT_FOUND\": 404\n    },\n    \"pagination\": \"?page (default 1) & ?pageSize (default 20, max 100) via the existing parsePagination()\",\n    \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler → requireUser/requireRole → parseQuery/parseBody(zod from src/lib/validators/notifications.ts) → service → ok()/paginated(), all from src/server/http.ts. No new error codes.\",\n    \"middleware\": \"src/middleware.ts still returns 401 UNAUTHENTICATED for sessionless /api/* requests. '/api/internal/' is added to PUBLIC_API_PATHS (src/config/public-routes.ts) so cron can reach the dispatch route, where CRON_SECRET is the only gate.\",\n    \"requirementIds\": [\"NFR-8\", \"NFR-11\", \"NFR-13\", \"FR-41\"]\n  },\n\n  \"sharedSchemas\": {\n    \"Notification\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"id\", \"type\", \"title\", \"body\", \"link\", \"readAt\", \"createdAt\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"type\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"key of NOTIFICATION_TYPES\" },\n        \"category\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"ACCOUNT\", \"ACADEMIC\", \"ATTENDANCE\", \"COMMUNICATION\", \"FINANCE\", \"SYSTEM\"], \"description\": \"derived from the registry and not stored\" },\n        \"title\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 140 },\n        \"body\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"], \"maxLength\": 500 },\n        \"link\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"], \"description\": \"safe relative path (isSafeRelativeLink) or null\" },\n        \"readAt\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"], \"format\": \"date-time\" },\n        \"createdAt\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-1\", \"FR-3\", \"NFR-6\", \"NFR-18\"]\n    },\n    \"NotificationPreferenceItem\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"type\", \"label\", \"description\", \"category\", \"inApp\", \"email\", \"mandatoryInApp\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"label\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"description\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"category\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"ACCOUNT\", \"ACADEMIC\", \"ATTENDANCE\", \"COMMUNICATION\", \"FINANCE\", \"SYSTEM\"] },\n        \"inApp\": { \"type\": \"boolean\", \"description\": \"always true when mandatoryInApp\" },\n        \"email\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n        \"mandatoryInApp\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" }\n      },\n      \"requirementIds\": [\"FR-7\", \"FR-28\", \"FR-29\", \"FR-37\"]\n    },\n    \"EmailLogItem\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"description\": \"EmailOutbox row WITHOUT html/\n1:# Tech Stack Decisions — PRD-04 Notifications & Email Infrastructure (SCH-004)\n36:## ADR-1: One additive Prisma migration for the existing PRD-04 models\n42:**Decision.** Run `prisma migrate dev --name notifications_email` without\n54:## ADR-2: Registry as a `const` object with `satisfies`; `keyof typeof` drives notify()\n59:**Decision.** In `src/server/notifications/types.ts`, define\n78:## ADR-3: Dispatcher claim through one raw-SQL `UPDATE … WHERE id IN (SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED) RETURNING *`\n84:**Decision.** Each `dispatchEmails({ batchSize = 50 })` run:\n110:## ADR-4: Retry backoff as a pure lookup table\n115:**Decision.** `src/server/email/backoff.ts` exports `const BACKOFF_MIN = [1, 5, 15, 60, 240]`\n124:## ADR-5: Email transport: Nodemailer for SMTP, a logger-free console transport, a lazy singleton\n130:**Decision.** `src/server/email/transport.ts` exports `sendMail({ to, toName, subject, html, text })`.\n146:## ADR-6: Email templates with @react-email/components, rendered at enqueue time\n151:**Decision.** Templates are `.tsx` components in `src/server/email/templates/`\n170:## ADR-7: Background dispatch as a cron-hit HTTP route plus an optional tsx worker loop; no queue library\n175:**Decision.**\n194:## ADR-8: Client UI with MUI v9 only, plain `fetch` polling, and no data-fetching library\n199:**Decision.**\n228:## ADR-9: Tests with the existing Vitest + Playwright; integration tests gated on a test DB\n234:**Decision.**\n253:## ADR-10: Link validation and field limits as shared pure helpers; validate in notify() without throwing\n258:**Decision.** Add `isSafeRelativeLink(s)` to `src/lib/validators/notifications.ts`.\n272:### Notes for downstream sub-tasks\nsrc/server/audit.ts\nsrc/server/csv.ts\nsrc/server/db.ts\nsrc/server/http.ts\nsrc/server/rate-limit.ts\n\nprisma/migrations:\n20261019000000_init\n20261019151500_user_management_profiles\n20261027000000_classes_enrollment\n20261104000000_auth_reconcile\nmigration_lock.toml\n\nsrc/app:\n(app)\n(auth)\n(public)\napi\nerror.tsx\nforbidden\nglobal-error.tsx\nlayout.tsx\nnot-found.tsx\nproviders.tsx\n\nsrc/app/(app):\nadmin\ncourses\ndashboard\nlayout.tsx\nmy-courses\nshell.tsx\nstudents\n\nsrc/components:\nConfirmDialog\nDataTable\nDateDisplay\nEmptyState\nFormField\nLoadingSkeleton\nPageHeader\nPasswordChecklist\nStatCard\nToast\nUserAvatar\nUserPicker\n\nsrc/server:\naudit.ts\nauth\ncourses\ncsv.ts\ndb.ts\nenrollment\nhttp.ts\nrate-limit.ts\nsections\nservices\n\nsrc/server/auth:\nauth.config.ts\nauth.ts\ncommon-passwords.txt\ncourse-access.ts\ncredentials.ts\nemail.ts\npassword-policy.ts\nrequireRole.ts\nstudent-access.ts\ntokens.ts\n\nsrc/server/courses:\ncourses-service.ts\n\nsrc/server/enrollment:\nroster-engine.ts\n\nsrc/server/sections:\nsections-service.ts\n\nsrc/server/services:\nacademicYears.ts\nauth.ts\ndateRange.ts\ngradeLevels.ts\nrooms.ts\nsettings.ts\nsubjects.ts\nterms.ts\nuserImport.ts\nuserLinks.ts\nusers.ts\n\ntests:\ne2e\nunit\n\ntests/e2e:\ndashboard.spec.ts\nlan