{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDjRjrpjo4z8uM9WkXQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PryVrof3QEZWt9LRtgFD7C","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/dev-planning/file-structure.md","content":"# File Structure — SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)\n\nPhase: dev-planning · 2026-11-05 · Brownfield, additive only (NFR-9).\n`(new)` = CREATE, `(edit)` = MODIFY. Nothing is deleted.\n\n## Path corrections vs. system-design.md §6 (checked on disk)\n\n| Design said | Actual path | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| `courses/[id]/schedule/page.tsx` | `src/app/(app)/courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx` | The existing course route segment is `[courseId]` (`roster/`, `CourseTabs.tsx`, `layout.tsx` live there). |\n| \"app-shell layout component\" | `src/app/(app)/shell.tsx` | `AppBar` + both `Drawer`s are rendered here. |\n| seed week constant inside `prisma/seed.ts` | `prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts` (new) | `prisma/seed.ts` calls `main()` at module load, so the unit test cannot import it without running the seed. |\n| period-overlap check only in the service | the pure `periodsOverlap()` helper goes in `clash-rules.ts` too | Lets `timetable-time.test.ts` test it without a DB (NFR-11). The service calls it. |\n\n## Tree\n\n```\npackage.json                                              (edit)  \"@dnd-kit/core\": \"6.3.1\"\npackage-lock.json                                         (edit)  via npm install\nprisma/\n  schema.prisma                                           (edit)  PeriodKind, Period, SchoolDay, TimetableSlot + 3 back-relations\n  migrations/20261105000000_timetable/migration.sql       (new)\n  seed.ts                                                 (edit)  seedPeriods, seedSchoolDays, seedTimetableFixtures, seedTimetableWeek\n  seed-timetable-week.ts                                  (new)   pure constant: 7A/7B week + ROBOTICS Wed P6\nsrc/\n  lib/\n    dates.ts                                              (edit)  schoolNow, nowAndNext\n    validators/timetable.ts                               (new)\n  server/timetable/\n    clash-rules.ts                                        (new)   pure: clashesForCell, periodsOverlap\n    timetable-service.ts                                  (new)   writes (TASK-5) + reads/exports/access (TASK-6)\n  app/\n    api/\n      periods/route.ts                                    (new)   GET, POST\n      periods/[id]/route.ts                               (new)   PATCH, DELETE\n      periods/reorder/route.ts                            (new)   POST\n      school-days/route.ts                                (new)   GET, PUT\n      timetable/route.ts                                  (new)   GET\n      timetable/availability/route.ts                     (new)   GET\n      timetable/free-rooms/route.ts                       (new)   GET\n      timetable/slots/route.ts                            (new)   POST\n      timetable/slots/[id]/route.ts                       (new)   PATCH, DELETE\n      me/timetable/route.ts                               (new)   GET\n    (app)/\n      shell.tsx                                           (edit)  data-print=\"hide\" on AppBar/Drawers\n      admin/timetable/\n        page.tsx                                          (new)\n        TimetableEditor.tsx                               (new)   client, DndContext\n        periods/page.tsx                                  (new)\n        periods/BellScheduleEditor.tsx                    (new)   client\n      timetable/\n        page.tsx                                          (new)\n        PersonalTimetable.tsx                             (new)   client, Week/Today\n      students/[id]/timetable/page.tsx                    (new)\n      courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx                (new)\n  components/TimetableGrid/\n    TimetableGrid.tsx                                     (new)\n    TimetablePrintStyles.tsx                              (new)\n    PrintButton.tsx                                       (new)\n    index.ts                                              (new)\n  config/\n    navigation.ts                                         (edit)  3 entries\n    student-tabs.ts                                       (edit)  timetable tab\n    course-tabs.ts                                        (edit)  schedule tab\ntests/\n  unit/timetable-clash.test.ts                            (new)\n  unit/timetable-time.test.ts                             (new)\n  unit/timetable-seed.test.ts                             (new)\n  integration/timetable-concurrency.test.ts               (new)   describe.runIf(TEST_DATABASE_URL)\n  e2e/timetable.spec.ts                                   (new)\n```\n\nTotals: 31 new files, 9 edited files, 40 paths.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2013,"cache_read_input_tokens":61134,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2013},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d4e282d-2f0d-4b8c-b946-a1776a0c1082","uuid":"383476c8-0973-479c-bcfd-8db679b6f504","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:22:02.134Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDjRQWMe1yvTSwgzkDW","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01PryVrof3QEZWt9LRtgFD7C":{"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/dev-planning/file-structure.md","content":"# File Structure — SH-6 (PRD-06 Bell Schedule & Timetable)\n\nPhase: dev-planning · 2026-11-05 · Brownfield, additive only (NFR-9).\n`(new)` = CREATE, `(edit)` = MODIFY. Nothing is deleted.\n\n## Path corrections vs. system-design.md §6 (checked on disk)\n\n| Design said | Actual path | Why |\n|---|---|---|\