{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDqoFaoGtZCEotrsCcw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev-planning phase for SH-6 is done: 16 tasks totalling 44 hours, and `implementation-plan.json` is marked `\"status\": \"complete\"`. A script checked the plan against the requirements before writing it:\n- The task list and the file-ownership matrix agree exactly (41 file entries).\n- Task dependencies have no cycles.\n- Every requirement id cited exists, and all 45 functional and 16 non-functional requirements are covered by at least one task.\n\nThe four files in `artifacts/dev-planning/` were from SH-4, so I replaced them: `file-structure.md`, `module-dependencies.json` and `file-ownership-matrix.json`, with `implementation-plan.json` written last.\n\n**Build order:**\n1. TASK-1: dependency, schema and migration.\n2. TASK-2 to TASK-4: validators, time helpers, and the clash rules with their unit tests.\n3. TASK-5 and TASK-6: the service, split into write and read halves.\n4. TASK-7 and TASK-8: API routes.\n5. TASK-9: the shared timetable grid.\n6. TASK-10 to TASK-14: pages, then navigation.\n7. TASK-15: seed data.\n8. TASK-16: concurrency and end-to-end tests, then the full lint/typecheck/test run.\n\n**Changes from the architect's file list, after checking the code on disk:**\n- **Course Schedule tab:** the page goes at `courses/[courseId]/schedule/page.tsx`, because the existing course route folder is `[courseId]`, not `[id]`.\n- **App shell:** the print-hiding attribute goes in `src/app/(app)/shell.tsx`, which is where the app bar and side drawers are rendered.\n- **Seed week data:** it moves to a new file, `prisma/seed-timetable-week.ts`. `prisma/seed.ts` runs the whole seed as soon as it's imported, so the seed test couldn't import the data from there.\n- **Period overlap check:** it becomes a small standalone function in `clash-rules.ts`, so it can be unit-tested without a database. The service calls it.\n- **Service file:** `timetable-service.ts` is split across TASK-5 (creates it) and TASK-6 (adds to it). That's the only file owned by two tasks.\n\nCarried-forward blocker for the dev phase: before writing any UI in TASK-9 to TASK-13, the dev agent must confirm the MUI docs lookup (mui-mcp) is reachable, and stop and report if it isn't."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":73818,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":712},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d4e282d-2f0d-4b8c-b946-a1776a0c1082","uuid":"0c7b1cf1-a36d-47ea-b7ce-f00b6fabc51e","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:23:23.412Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDqo2vzdJJ3iqDXiqLe"}
