{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LYtfGC8jES72VD3rYZsWkX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\n \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-05T12:10:00Z\",\n \"phase\": \"architect\",\n \"version\": \"1.0\",\n \"conventions\": {\n  \"basePath\": \"/api (existing project convention; no /api/v1 prefix \\u2014 NFR-13 forbids renaming routes)\",\n  \"scope\": \"SH-1 adds NO new endpoints (system-design.md \\u00a71, ADR-1). Every contract below documents an EXISTING route that the new pages (C1\\u2013C5) and tests (C12) call. Dev must not modify src/app/api/** or src/server/**.\",\n  \"successEnvelope\": {\n   \"data\": \"<responseSchema>\"\n  },\n  \"errorEnvelope\": {\n   \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"string\",\n    \"message\": \"string\",\n    \"details\": \"unknown?\"\n   }\n  },\n  \"errorCodes\": {\n   \"VALIDATION_ERROR\": 400,\n   \"UNAUTHENTICATED\": 401,\n   \"FORBIDDEN\": 403,\n   \"NOT_FOUND\": 404,\n   \"CONFLICT\": 409,\n   \"INVALID_TOKEN\": 410,\n   \"RATE_LIMITED\": 429,\n   \"INTERNAL\": 500\n  },\n  \"validationErrorDetails\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR details are Zod flatten() output: { formErrors: string[], fieldErrors: { [field]: string[] } }. Service-raised policy errors use the same { fieldErrors } shape, so applyFieldErrors() handles both.\",\n  \"handlerPattern\": \"withHandler \\u2192 (requireUser) \\u2192 parseBody(schema from src/lib/validators/auth.ts) \\u2192 services/auth.ts \\u2192 ok(). All helpers in src/server/http.ts.\",\n  \"requirementIds\": [\n   \"NFR-10\",\n   \"NFR-11\",\n   \"NFR-13\"\n  ]\n },\n \"sharedSchemas\": {\n  \"Email\": {\n   \"type\": \"string\",\n   \"format\": \"email\",\n   \"note\": \"trimmed and lower-cased by emailField before use\"\n  },\n  \"NewPassword\": {\n   \"type\": \"string\",\n   \"minLength\": 10,\n   \"maxLength\": 128,\n   \"note\": \"\\u22651 letter, \\u22651 digit, \\u2260 user email, not in common-passwords.txt (server-side only). FR-15.\"\n  },\n  \"Ok\": {\n   \"type\": \"object\",\n   \"required\": [\n    \"ok\"\n   ],\n   \"properties\": {\n    \"ok\": {\n     \"const\": true\n    }\n   }\n  },\n  \"FieldErrors\": {\n   \"type\": \"object\",\n   \"properties\": {\n    \"formErrors\": {\n     \"type\": \"array\",\n     \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n     }\n    },\n    \"fieldErrors\": {\n     \"type\": \"object\",\n     \"additionalProperties\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n       \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n     }\n    }\n   }\n  }\n },\n \"unauthenticatedBehaviour\": {\n  \"description\": \"middleware.ts (existing): unauthenticated /api/* requests other than /api/health, /api/auth/* and public-routes.ts paths return 401 { error: { code: 'UNAUTHENTICATED' } }; unauthenticated (app) page requests redirect to /login?callbackUrl=<path>.\",\n  \"requirementIds\": [\n   \"FR-11\",\n   \"NFR-9\"\n  ]\n },\n \"designCorrections\": [\n  \"system-design.md C3 posts `confirmPassword`; the real field is `confirm` (resetPasswordSchema / acceptInviteSchema / changePasswordSchema).\",\n  \"system-design.md R3 says INVALID_TOKEN is 400; src/server/http.ts maps it to 410.\",\n  \"system-design.md C5 doesn't cover common-password errors on /api/account/password: they arrive under fieldErrors.password and must be remapped to newPassword on the client. Fix this in ChangePasswordForm, not in the service (NFR-13).\"\n ],\n \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n1:# Tech Stack Decisions — PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC (SCH-001)\n27:## ADR-1: Keep the declared stack unchanged and add no dependency\n40:## ADR-2: Sign-in uses the client `signIn('credentials', { redirect: false })` from `next-auth/react`, with errors mapped from `result.code`\n58:## ADR-3: The shell gets the current user from the server `auth()` through a prop; there is no `SessionProvider`\n73:## ADR-4: The token pages verify on the server first; set-password forms are client RHF forms that post to the existing JSON APIs\n93:## ADR-5: