{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgk6yMrHMgNq4MJ1XAYvy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've rewritten the SH-1 dev-planning output in `artifacts/dev-planning/` from the latest architect design. The old plan (11:47) was built from an earlier design, so I replaced it. The new plan has 9 tasks covering 14 files (10 new, 4 modified), estimated at 17 hours, with `status: \"complete\"`.\n\nA script checked the plan before writing it:\n- **Matrix match:** every file in the plan appears in `file-ownership-matrix.json` under the same task, and the other way round.\n- **Requirement ids:** every id cited by a task exists in `requirements.json`.\n- **Dependencies:** they form a DAG; each task only depends on earlier ones.\n- **Valid output:** all JSON files parse, and `implementation-plan.json` was written last.\n\n| Task | What it builds | Depends on |\n|---|---|---|\n| TASK-1 | `/forgot-password` page and form | – |\n| TASK-2 | `TokenPasswordForm`, shared by the invite and reset pages | – |\n| TASK-3 | `/reset-password/[token]` page | 2 |\n| TASK-4 | `/invite/[token]` page | 2 |\n| TASK-5 | `/account/security` page and `ChangePasswordForm` | – |\n| TASK-6 | `(app)/layout.tsx` and `shell.tsx`: remove `PLACEHOLDER_USER`, add the user menu and Sign out | 5 |\n| TASK-7 | `tests/integration/auth.test.ts` | – |\n| TASK-8 | Shared e2e `signInAs` helper; the dashboard and notifications specs use it | 6 |\n| TASK-9 | `tests/e2e/auth.spec.ts` | 1, 3, 6, 8 |\n\nWhere the architect's documents disagreed, I wrote the correct version into the task descriptions so the Dev agent doesn't hit them:\n- The token forms send `confirm`, not `confirmPassword`.\n- `ChangePasswordForm` must move the server's `password` error onto the `newPassword` field, or common-password errors won't show anywhere.\n- Sign out uses `signOut({ redirectTo: '/login' })`, not the older `callbackUrl` wording.\n- `/forgot-password` shows an error message when rate-limited, rather than the success message.\n\nTASK-8 is needed because `dashboard.spec.ts` currently opens `/dashboard` without signing in. That spec would fail once the layout requires a signed-in user.\n\nNine requirements (FR-1, FR-9, FR-22, FR-29, FR-30, FR-32, FR-33, NFR-4, NFR-10) have no task. Existing code already covers them, and the plan lists them under `requirementsSatisfiedByExistingCode`.\n\nThree things need attention before Dev runs:\n- **Stale downstream files:** the dev, QA and UI-verification artifacts, and `approvals/dev-planning-approval.json` (11:58), all belong to the old plan. Some even carry other ticket ids (SH-4, SH-6). They should be cleared or regenerated, and the new plan needs a fresh approval.\n- **FR-32 sign-off:** keeping the audit log's IP column named `ip` (not `ipAddress`) still needs a human decision. No task depends on it.\n- **MUI docs lookup (NFR-6):** TASK-1, 2, 5 and 6 must look up the MUI docs through mui-mcp before writing UI, and stop if it can't be reached."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":597,"cache_read_input_tokens":80982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":597},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e695f9e3-b58d-43ba-a40f-80582ccbd08f","uuid":"0b6f17cc-c3eb-4cc3-9ade-fe3f49e9da91","timestamp":"2026-11-05T16:33:56.109Z","request_id":"req_011Cgk6yMecp2wpy9QtqfizF"}
