{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgroxdE26XSHMuzYBZgbK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The SH-9 dev-planning phase is finished. All four artifacts are in `artifacts/dev-planning/` and replace the leftover files from earlier tickets. `implementation-plan.json` was written last, has `\"status\": \"complete\"` and contains 26 tasks totalling 56.5 hours.\n\n**What I checked:**\n- **Files match:** the plan and `file-ownership-matrix.json` list exactly the same 55 file paths under the same task ids (39 new, 15 modified, 1 deleted).\n- **Paths match the repo:** every file marked as modified or deleted already exists, and no file marked as new exists yet.\n- **Paths follow existing conventions:** API routes use `[id]`, course pages use `[courseId]`, and each server `page.tsx` passes data to a client component in the same folder.\n- **Requirements:** every requirement id in a task exists in `requirements.json`, and all 61 FRs and 17 NFRs are covered by at least one task.\n- **Task order:** task dependencies only point to earlier tasks, so there are no cycles.\n\n**How the work is ordered:**\n1. **Environment fixes (TASK-1):** pin the MUI X internals package and fix the Vitest config.\n2. **Data and core logic (TASK-2 to TASK-7):** the database migration, then the grading-math, dates and validator helpers, then one large task for the assignments service. TASK-7 is estimated at 8 hours because the design puts all the database logic in that single file.\n3. **Server pieces (TASK-8 to TASK-13):** reminders, file access rules, three groups of API routes, and the header change for PDF previews.\n4. **UI (TASK-14 to TASK-23):** shared components, then the pages.\n5. **Seed data and tests (TASK-24 to TASK-26).**\n\n**Before dev starts:**\n- **Decision for you:** the two architect documents disagree about `next.config.js`. The tech-stack decisions say not to touch it, but the later system design changes one security header so PDFs can preview inline. I followed the system design (TASK-13). A reviewer should sign off on that header change. The fallback is a plain \"Open\" link for PDFs with no header change.\n- **Gates for dev:** the MUI docs server (mui-mcp) must be reachable before any UI work (TASK-14 to TASK-23). The MUI X version pin in TASK-1 must also compile, or the table and date picker switch to the simpler fallbacks the architect defined.\n- **Known gaps carried forward:** the per-student Assignments page is reachable only by URL because nothing renders student tabs yet. The site-wide security-policy fix for the browser is out of scope, so the e2e test bypasses it.\n\nFiles are in `artifacts/dev-planning/`:\n- implementation-plan.json\n- file-ownership-matrix.json\n- module-dependencies.json\n- file-structure.md"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":887,"cache_read_input_tokens":76025,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":887},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f7fec35-982c-43e2-a849-2d541adb85ed","uuid":"52cf04d4-4b4f-4ae3-9742-38da2ec6b501","timestamp":"2026-11-09T05:34:57.737Z","request_id":"req_011Cgroxd2bpM7fiNfomCCDo"}
