{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WG8xidf7sD3BbQ2CLGVLUN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"SH-10\",\n3\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T13:05:00Z\",\n4\t  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n5\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"status\": \"complete\",\n8\t  \"endpointCount\": 19,\n9\t  \"artifacts\": [\n10\t    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n11\t    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n12\t    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n13\t    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n14\t  ],\n15\t  \"notes\": [\n16\t    \"19 endpoint entries. 18 are new route methods in 14 route files (system-design §3.3). 1 is the existing POST /api/internal/email/dispatch, whose contract is unchanged; it gains two maintenance calls (FR-18, FR-30, FR-35).\",\n17\t    \"Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts. Only GET /api/courses/:id/quizzes is paginated.\",\n18\t    \"Decimals are fixed2 strings in all responses. Student and parent payloads come only from serializers.ts (toStudentQuiz / toStudentAttempt / toStudentResult); `correct`/explanation appear only in StudentResult when resultsVisible && showCorrectAnswers (NFR-1).\",\n19\t    \"Contract decision: the manual grade body field is `pointsAwarded` (PRD API table), not `points` as written in system-design §3.2. manualGradeSchema must use pointsAwarded.\",\n20\t    \"Contract additions inside existing design elements: StudentAttempt.serverNow (timer skew correction, display only); ManagerQuiz.locked/publishProblems/totalPoints; POST /attempts returns 201 on create and 200 on resume; submit is idempotent and returns StudentResult.\",\n21\t    \"No HTTP endpoint for getStudentQuizScore (TS export for PRD-11), the grading workspace reads, the analytics page reads, or the accommodations list. Server pages call the services directly.\",\n22\t    \"Stale leftovers from SH-9: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/* and artifacts/dev/* must be regenerated for SH-10, not reused.\"\n23\t  ],\n24\t  \"blockers\": [],\n25\t  \"devGates\": [\n26\t    \"NFR-4 / ADR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component; if it is unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",\n27\t    \"ADR-2: the partial unique index quiz_attempt_one_in_progress_uq is raw SQL in the migration. Dev and CI must use prisma migrate, never db push.\"\n28\t  ],\n29\t  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n30\t}\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b645f7e9-4c81-4aba-958f-4af4a7329b6d","uuid":"517997c6-4378-4e11-beb0-d12999ecc7e8","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:10:02.156Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/handoff-to-dev-planning.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-10\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T13:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 19,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"19 endpoint entries. 18 are new route methods in 14 route files (system-design §3.3). 1 is the existing POST /api/internal/email/dispatch, whose contract is unchanged; it gains two maintenance calls (FR-18, FR-30, FR-35).\",\n    \"Base path is /api (existing convention), not /api/v1. Envelopes, error codes and pagination come from src/server/http.ts. Only GET /api/courses/:id/quizzes is paginated.\",\n    \"Decimals are fixed2 strings in all responses. Student and parent payloads come only from serializers.ts (toStudentQuiz / toStudentAttempt / toStudentResult); `correct`/explanation appear only in StudentResult when resultsVisible && showCorrectAnswers (NFR-1).\",\n    \"Contract decision: the manual grade body field is `pointsAwarded` (PRD API table), not `points` as written in system-design §3.2. manualGradeSchema must use pointsAwarded.\",\n    \"Contract additions inside existing design elements: StudentAttempt.serverNow (timer skew correction, display only); ManagerQuiz.locked/publishProblems/totalPoints; POST /attempts returns 201 on create and 200 on resume; submit is idempotent and returns StudentResult.\",\n    \"No HTTP endpoint for getStudentQuizScore (TS export for PRD-11), the grading workspace reads, the analytics page reads, or the accommodations list. Server pages call the services directly.\",\n    \"Stale leftovers from SH-9: artifacts/architect/threat-model-notes.json, artifacts/dev-planning/* and artifacts/dev/* must be regenerated for SH-10, not reused.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"devGates\": [\n    \"NFR-4 / ADR-7: dev must reach mui-mcp (useMuiDocs → fetchDocs) before writing any UI component; if it is unreachable, stop and report. This does not block dev-planning.\",\n    \"ADR-2: the partial unique index quiz_attempt_one_in_progress_uq is raw SQL in the migration. Dev and CI must use prisma migrate, never db push.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WG8xidf7sD3BbQ2CLGVLUN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
