p1 once at the end, letterFor, effectiveScale, applyOverride (letter-only, percent-only re-derives letter A12), gradeColour. Reuse Decimal/dec/fixed2 from assignments/grading-math.ts. Unit matrix incl. FR-15 golden 78.0 C+, 89.95 -> 90.0 -> A-, AC-2, AC-5, AC-6.\",\n  [(G+'grade-calc.ts','CREATE'),('tests/unit/gradebook/grade-calc.test.ts','CREATE')],[1],5,['FR-10','FR-11','FR-12','FR-13','FR-14','FR-15','NFR-1','NFR-12']),\n (\"Pure termFor(date, terms, tz, now): containing term by school-local date (schoolToday + getSchoolTimezone), fall back to term containing today, else null (A6). Unit test tz day boundaries, fallback, null.\",\n  [(G+'term-placement.ts','CREATE'),('tests/unit/gradebook/term-placement.test.ts','CREATE')],[1],1.5,['FR-3','NFR-10','NFR-12']),\n (\"Gradebook sync module: upsertItemFromAssignment/upsertItemFromQuiz (isVisible only on visibility transition A7, re-place term only when dueAt/availableUntil changes A10, skip+logger.warn when no term), hideItemForSource, deleteItemForSource, syncSubmissionGrade (RETURNED only, excused from GradeExemption, A1), syncQuizGrade/syncQuizGrades (GRADED + resultsVisible + not practice; use existing getStudentQuizScore in quiz/attempt-service.ts, do NOT create a second one; scale to maxPoints). Export pure row builders itemFromAssignment, gradeFromSubmission, gradeFromQuizScore for backfill.\",\n  [(G+'gradebook-sync.ts','CREATE')],[1,4],4,['FR-3','FR-4','FR-5','FR-6','FR-7','NFR-5','NFR-9']),\n (\"Assignment hooks (one call each): createAssignment/updateAssignment/publishOnce -> upsertItemFromAssignment(tx); deleteOrArchiveAssignment -> hideItemForSource (archive) / deleteItemForSource (hard delete) in same tx; gradeSubmission/bulkReturn/gradeOffline -> syncSubmissionGrade only when RETURNED after write (AC-3); setExemption (both branches) -> syncSubmissionGrade. Add optional nullable categoryId to assignment Zod schemas.\",\n  [('src/server/assignments/assignments-service.ts',M),('src/lib/validators/assignmen