{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsLSrVk86syU5ZVHa12i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written the SH-11 dev-planning artifacts to `artifacts/dev-planning/`, replacing the leftovers from SH-10. The plan has **33 tasks covering 77 files, estimated at 107.5 hours, with status `complete`**.\n\n- **`file-structure.md`**: the planned file tree, marking which files are new or changed and which task owns each one.\n- **`module-dependencies.json`**: which modules depend on which.\n- **`file-ownership-matrix.json`**: 77 entries. A script check confirmed they match the task file lists in the plan exactly.\n- **`implementation-plan.json`**: written last. The script also checked that task dependencies have no cycles, every requirement ID exists in `requirements.json`, all 42 functional and 13 non-functional requirements are covered, and no file is owned by two tasks.\n\n**Order of the work:**\n1. Database migration, then validators, the grade calculation, and term placement.\n2. Sync module, then the assignment and quiz hooks, the backfill script, and the shared data loader.\n3. Services and API routes for scales, categories, gradebook, student grades, and report cards.\n4. Configuration (tabs and navigation), then the UI pages and grid.\n5. Seed data, then the Playwright tests.\n\n**Places where I chose between conflicting upstream documents:**\n- **Sync file name:** `src/server/gradebook/gradebook-sync.ts`, as the system design says, not the `sync.ts` named in ADR-5.\n- **Quiz score:** the plan reuses `getStudentQuizScore`, which already exists in `src/server/quiz/attempt-service.ts`. The plan explicitly tells dev not to create a second copy (ADR-6 had said to write a new one).\n- **Backfill:** the logic goes in `src/server/gradebook/backfill.ts`, with a thin command-line wrapper in `scripts/gradebook-backfill.ts`.\n\n**Decisions of my own:**\n- **Migration folder:** `20261111000000_add_gradebook`, so it sorts after the latest existing migration.\n- **Unplaced files:** the system design didn't say where these go, so I chose:\n  - The report card print components go in `src/components/report-cards/`.\n  - Page components sit next to their `page.tsx`, matching the rest of the app.\n  - The parent's child selector on `/grades` is a small `GradesClient.tsx`.\n\nI left out the optional performance test that the system design marks as skippable in CI. It can be added if QA needs proof of the two speed targets (35×80 gradebook load under 800 ms, report-card generation for 600 students under 30 s)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1096,"cache_read_input_tokens":83345,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1096},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"055adbad-09fd-4ef0-894f-863fb13f0fba","uuid":"da3a32d2-b448-4450-a0d3-5ad0550cfafa","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:14:45.205Z","request_id":"req_011CgsLSrGr6pj2vd6fmrzzy"}
