{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B1HtqXF5Qwx5Q77sxhioFa","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"SH-12\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-09T19:35:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"architect\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"endpointCount\": 12,\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    \"artifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/system-design.md\",\n    \"artifacts/architect/api-contracts.json\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"12 endpoints across 10 route files (matching system-design §2.6 and the PRD API table, FR-34), plus 2 existing endpoints extended without contract change: /api/internal/email/dispatch (publishDueAnnouncements, FR-27) and /api/files/:id (the 'announcement' context, FR-30).\",\n    \"Base path is /api, not /api/v1. Envelopes, pagination (default 20, max 100; manage max 50) and error codes come from src/server/http.ts. RATE_LIMITED 429 already exists in ApiErrorCode.\",\n    \"Error policy: targeting violations → 403 (AC-3). Non-member, not-visible or non-owner access to a specific announcement → 404. State conflicts (author editing ARCHIVED, ack without requiresAck, remind when !requiresAck) → 409. Second reminder within 24h → 429 with details.retryAfter (FR-25, ADR-4).\",\n    \"Contract decisions beyond system-design: zero-recipient publish returns VALIDATION_ERROR with details.reason='NO_RECIPIENTS'. PATCH mode=draft on a PUBLISHED row is 409 (archive instead). Archive is idempotent. Ack also sets readAt if it was empty. Remind with nobody left still claims the throttle and returns notified: 0. On feed page 1, pinned items are lifted to the top and meta.total excludes them. Manage accepts an optional ?status filter on displayStatus. Percentages are integers rounded half-up, or null when the denominator is 0.\",\n    \"Schema addition: Announcement.lastRemindedAt DateTime? (FR-25), already listed in system-design §1.\",\n    \"NotifyInput gains an optional mandatoryInApp override (system-design A9) so announcement.published stays a single type key (FR-26).\",\n    \"Shared DTOs (AudienceRow, AnnouncementInput, FeedItem, AnnouncementDetail, AudienceCounts) are in api-contracts.json `components`. src/lib/validators/announcements.ts should mirror them.\"\n  ],\n  \"nextPhase\": \"dev-planning\"\n}\n20261108000000_add_files_and_content\n20261109000000_add_assignments\n20261110000000_add_quizzes\n20261111000000_add_gradebook\nmigration_lock.toml\nls: src/app/(app)/courses/[id]: No such file or directory\nsrc/app/(app):\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattendance\ncourses\ndashboard\ngrades\nlayout.tsx\nmy-courses\nnotifications\nquizzes\nreport-cards\nshell.tsx\nstudents\nls: src/app/api/public: No such file or directory\nsrc/app/api:\nacademic-years\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattempts\nattendance\naudit-logs\nauth\ncourses\nenrollments\nfiles\ngrade-items\ngrade-levels\ngrading-scales\nhealth\ninternal\nme\nnotifications\nperiods\nquestions\nquizzes\nreport-cards\nrooms\nschool-days\nsections\nsettings\nstudents\nsubjects\nsubmissions\nterms\ntimetable\nusers\nConfirmDialog\nDataTable\nDateDisplay\nEmptyState\nFileList\nFileUpload\nFormField\ngradebook\nLoadingSkeleton\nMarkdownEditor\nMarkdownView\nNotificationBell\nPageHeader\nPasswordChecklist\nreport-cards\nStatCard\nToast\nUserAvatar\nUserPicker\n(eval):1: no matches found: --include=*.tsx\ntests:\ne2e\nintegration\nunit\n\ntests/e2e:\nassignments.spec.ts\nattendance.spec.ts\nauth-qa.spec.ts\nauth.spec.ts\ndashboard.spec.ts\ngradebook.spec.ts\nhelpers\nlanding.spec.ts\nnotifications.spec.ts\nquizzes.spec.ts\nreport-cards.spec.ts\n\ntests/integration:\nassignments\nattendance-qa.test.ts\nattendance-service.test.ts\nauth.test.ts\nemail-dispatch.test.ts\nfiles-qa.test.ts\ngradebook\nquiz\nreport-cards\ntimetable-concurrency.test.ts\n\ntests/unit:\nassignments\nattendance-register-form.test.tsx\